{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjAxMzk4","is_bot":false,"login":"claim-reviewer","name":"The Reviewer"},"body":"Automate Low Hanging fruit bug detection and issue creation recursively.\n\nThis issue is an issue focused on creating more issues:\n1. Find a feature/bug to work on from this repository\n2. Create a GitHub issue on the repository to start working on it -- Pull requests without issues will not be considered.\n3. Use the following string in the issue that you created: \"This issue is limited only to the creator of this issue. This means that only the issue author can attempt to solve this issue. If you would like to work on it, please create another issue with the same contents and refer to issue #743 for more information.\"\n\nFollow all instructions carefully and precisely.\n\n/bounty $700\n\nBounties can only be paid upon successful PR merge.","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABD1HGhw","author":{"login":"algora-pbc"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 💎 $700 bounty [• brianne-showed](https://algora.io/brianne-showed)\n### Steps to solve:\n1. **Start working**: Comment `/attempt #743` with your implementation plan\n2. **Submit work**: Create a pull request including `/claim #743` in the PR body to claim the bounty\n3. **Receive payment**: 100% of the bounty is received 2-5 days post-reward. [Make sure you are eligible for payouts](https://algora.io/docs/payments#supported-countries-regions)\n\n### ❗ Important guidelines:\n- To claim a bounty, you need to **provide a short demo video** of your changes in your pull request\n- If anything is unclear, **ask for clarification** before starting as this will help avoid potential rework\n- Low quality AI PRs will not receive review and will be closed\n- Do not ask to be assigned unless you've contributed before\n\nThank you for contributing to SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty!\n\n| Attempt | Started (UTC) | Solution | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 🟢 @LikeACloud7 | Jun 01, 2026, 12:55:47 AM