,"viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABENY-1w","author":{"login":"aiautotool"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #1677 for a narrow frontend bug: the job detail route renders a successful placeholder for every job id instead of resolving known mock jobs and returning 404 for unknown ids.\n\nPlan: keep the change limited to `apps/web/app/jobs/[id]/page.tsx`, look up the id in `apps/web/lib/mock.ts`, call `notFound()` for missing jobs, render matching title/budget for valid jobs, and verify with `npm run build -w apps/web`.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T16:19:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4577443543","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABENZq6A","author":{"login":"aiautotool"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nSubmitted scoped fix #1677 in PR #1678: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1678\n\nSummary:\n- `/jobs/[id]` now resolves ids from `apps/web/lib/mock.ts` instead of rendering a generic placeholder\n- known job ids render the matching title and budget\n- unknown job ids call `notFound()`\n\nValidation:\n- `npm run build -w apps/web` -> passed\n- `git diff --check` -> passed\n\nNo payout address, private token, cookie value, seed phrase, API key, personal information, or hidden runtime metadata is included.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T16:21:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4577454824","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABENZwhw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Status refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity, including scoped issue #1673 and #1677 attempts.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains:\n- Scoped issue: #1632\n- PR: #1634\n- State: open and