e\n- Bounty claim label: present\n- `/claim #743`: present in the PR body\n- Demo evidence: embedded in the PR body and PR comments\n- Algora: #1634 is already indexed in the #743 table with a Reward link: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix. It is separate from the newer broad audit attempt, PR #1678's job-detail route slice, scoped issue #1673's auth validation / refresh-token handling, scoped issue #1668's proposal estimated-duration validation, and PR #1300 / scoped issue #1667's auth-cookie/token-response work. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T16:38:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4577597060","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEOMjBA","author":{"login":"arisnachy"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #1695 for the rate-limiter-before-body-parser bug. I will keep the fix limited to moving API rate-limit accounting before JSON body parsing and adding a focused regression test proving repeated malformed JSON requests eventually receive 429 instead of bypassing the limiter through parser errors.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:03:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4578288388","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEORcUw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Status refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity, including @arisnachy's scoped issue #1695 for rate-limiter-before-body-parser handling.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains:\n- Scoped issue: #1632\n- PR: #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- State: open, non-draft, CLEAN/mergeable\n- Bounty claim label: present\n- `/claim #743`: present in the PR body\n- Demo evidence: embedded in the PR body and PR comments\n- Algora: #1634 is already indexed in the #743 table with a Reward link: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix. It is separate from the newer rate-limiter-before-body-parser slice in #1695, PR #1678's job-detail route slice, scoped issue #1673's auth validation / refresh-token handling, scoped issue #1668's proposal estimated-duration validation, and PR #1300 / scoped issue #1667's auth-cookie/token-response work. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:10:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4578368595","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEObvEg","author":{"login":"Jorel97"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"﻿/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #1700 for the missing API environment example. Plan: add `apps/api/.env.example` with documented safe development placeholders for the variables read by `apps/api/src/config/env.js`, add a short README setup note that points contributors to copy it, validate the docs/config references, and submit a focused PR with `/claim #743` plus a short demo.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:24:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4578537234","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEOcBQA","author":{"login":"aglichandrap"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I have created a low-hanging fruit improvement for the repository.\n\n**Issue created:** #1699\n**PR:** #1701\n\n## What I Did\n\nFound that the API was missing a `.env.example` file, which is essential for developer onboarding. Created a comprehensive environment configuration template.\n\n### Files Added:\n- `apps/api/.env.example` - Complete environment configuration template\n\n### Impact:\n- Reduces onboarding friction for new contributors\n- Documents all required configuration in one place\n- Prevents missing environment variable errors\n- Standard practice for open-source projects\n\nThis follows the pattern of finding a useful improvement, creating an issue, and submitting a PR to fix it.\n\nI have signed up and would like to claim this bounty. 🍇","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:25:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4578541888","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEOdNoQ","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Status refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity, including @Jorel97's scoped issue #1700 and @aglichandrap's scoped issue #1699 / PR #1701.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains:\n- Scoped issue: #1632\n- PR: #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- State: open, non-draft, CLEAN/mergeable\n- Bounty claim label: present\n- `/claim #743`: present in the PR body\n- Demo evidence: embedded in the PR body and PR comments\n- Algora: #1634 is already indexed in the #743 table with a Reward link: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix. It is separate from the newer API `.env.example` documentation slices in #1699/#1700 and PR #1701, the rate-limiter-before-body-parser slice in #1695, PR #1678's job-detail route slice, scoped issue #1673's auth validation / refresh-token handling, scoped issue #1668's proposal estimated-duration validation, and PR #1300 / scoped issue #1667's auth-cookie/token-response work. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:27:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4578561441","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEP86pA","author":{"login":"Akamai01"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix the scoped issue I created in #1716. The registration schema currently lets public users submit `role: \"admin\"`, and the refresh controller ignores the request token before minting a replacement token. I will restrict public registration roles to `client`/`freelancer`, validate and pass the refresh token through the controller, verify it in the service before signing a replacement token with the verified subject/role, and include focused regression tests.\n","createdAt":"2026-05-29T21:48:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4580129444","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEP98LQ","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Status refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity, including @Akamai01's scoped issue #1716 for registration role and refresh-token handling.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains:\n- Scoped issue: #1632\n- PR: #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- State: open, non-draft\n- Scope: focused freelancer search skill separator fix with reproducible demo evidence\n- Claim: /claim #743 in the PR body\n\nThis stays separate from newer scoped issues and remains ready for maintainer review.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T21:50:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4580146221","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABERDOGA","author":{"login":"wangedmund77-cmyk"},"authorAssociation":"NONE",