SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 is CLEAN/mergeable\n- PR #1634 has the `🙋 Bounty claim` label\n- `update-leaderboard` check is successful\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- Scope remains the freelancer search UI separator fix with demo GIF and build validation listed in the PR body\n\nNo contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T04:43:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4581682398","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABER0RQw","author":{"login":"sodalone"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix the creator-owned PostCSS audit advisory issue #1874 by adding a root npm override for `postcss@8.5.10`, refreshing `package-lock.json`, and validating that `npm audit --omit=dev` no longer reports GHSA-qx2v-qp2m-jg93 while keeping the existing Next version.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T07:27:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582084931","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABER16Cg","author":{"login":"sodalone"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Expanding my /attempt #743 work to include creator-owned issue #1888: patch `qs@6.15.1` to `qs@6.15.2` via the same root override/lockfile audit-cleanup PR, so `npm audit --omit=dev` reaches 0 vulnerabilities.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T07:35:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582111754","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABER4Wag","author":{"login":"sodalone"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #1891 by changing the API workspace test script from the `src/tests` directory path to an explicit `src/tests/**/*.test.js` glob, then verify root `npm test` succeeds.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T07:48:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582151786","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABER6xhA","author":{"login":"sodalone"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #1893 by adding an async route wrapper, forwarding rejected controller promises to Express error middleware, returning 400 JSON for Zod validation errors, and adding a regression test for invalid `/api/jobs` payloads.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T08:01:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582191492","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABER7-sw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Status refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @sodalone, including scoped issues #1874/#1888/#1891/#1893 and related PRs #1875/#1892/#1895.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 is MERGEABLE\n- PR #1634 has the `?? Bounty claim` label\n- `update-leaderboard` check is successful\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search UI separator fix with demo GIF and build validation listed in the PR body. This is distinct from the newer PostCSS/qs audit cleanup, API test glob, async validation wrapper, and other API/auth scoped submissions. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-05-30T08:07:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582211251","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABER9vkw","author":{"login":"sodalone"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #1910 by replacing the `/billing` placeholder sentence with a focused account billing overview: balance, payment method, next billing date, invoice rows, and recent transactions. I will keep it scoped to the web page and verify with the web production build.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T08:16:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582240147","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABER_GSw","author":{"login":"sodalone"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #1912 by adding main navigation links for the existing `/jobs/post`, `/notifications`, `/billing`, and `/settings` routes, then verify the web production build.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T08:24:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582262347","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESAWaQ","author":{"login":"sodalone"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #1917 by replacing the `/jobs/post` placeholder with a client-side draft form, required-field and budget validation feedback, and a live draft preview. I will keep the change scoped to the web page and verify with the web production build.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T08:32:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimize