hub.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582425118","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESL21Q","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @Akamai01 on the `/notifications` placeholder page, plus newer #743 PR activity including #1936/#1940/#1942/#1948/#1949/#1958/#1962.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 is MERGEABLE\n- PR #1634 has the Bounty claim label\n- `update-leaderboard` is successful\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search UI separator fix with demo GIF and build validation. This is distinct from the newer messaging/notifications placeholders, admin/auth/payment/job/security, audit, and other low-hanging-fruit scoped submissions. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T09:55:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582471381","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESRIlg","author":{"login":"Jorel97"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #1977 by adding a dedicated auth rate limiter for `POST /api/auth/register`, `POST /api/auth/login`, and `POST /api/auth/refresh`, keeping ordinary non-auth API traffic on the existing general limiter. I will include a regression test proving the 11th auth attempt is blocked with HTTP 429 and verify `npm test`.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T10:38:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582557846","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESRx-g","author":{"login":"Jorel97"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #1979 by adding an explicit OAuth provider allowlist for the callback route, returning HTTP 400 for unsupported provider names, and adding regression tests for both accepted and rejected provider paths. I will verify with `npm test` and include a short demo video in the PR body.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T10:44:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582568442","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESR5cw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @Jorel97 on scoped issue #1977 / auth rate limiting.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 has the Bounty claim label\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search UI separator fix with demo evidence and build validation. This is distinct from the newer auth rate-limiter scoped issue and other API/auth/security submissions. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T10:45:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582570355","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESUEiA","author":{"login":"cedar323"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nI created scoped issue #1984 for the job creation status bug. Plan: keep the fix limited to `apps/api/src/services/jobService.js`, make newly-created jobs use the server-owned Prisma enum status `OPEN`, prevent caller-supplied `status` from overriding the initial state, and add a focused `node:test` regression covering default status and override behavior.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T11:03:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582605960","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESUmOw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @cedar323 on scoped issue #1984.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 has the Bounty claim label\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. This is distinct from #1984's job creation status bug and the other API/auth/security scoped submissions. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T11:08:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582614587","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESbMpw","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #1993 by validating `GET /api/search` query input at the controller boundary. The change will reject non-string or over-200-character query values with HTTP 400, trim valid queries before calling the search service, and add focused API regression tests showing both normal trimmed search behavior and oversized-query rejection.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T11:43:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582722727","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESb8ow","author":{"login":"keilogic"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #1997 by making notification creation use a server-owned unread initial state. The change will keep `apps/api/src/services/notificationService.js` scoped, prevent caller payloads from overriding `read: false`, and add focused `node:test` regression coverage for default unread status plus `read: true` override prevention.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T11:49:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582735011","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEScTxQ","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nI will fix #2000 by replacing the hardcoded `next start -p 3000` web start command with a small Node startup wrapper that uses `PORT` when provided and falls back to `3000`, plus a Node test for the port resolver.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T11:52:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582740933","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESdSpg","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nI will fix #2005 by updating the dynamic Next app-router pages so `params` is awaited with the expected async PageProps shape, preserving the current rendered content and verifying with the web production build.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T12:00:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582757030","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESeIiw","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nI will fix #2008 by updating the README workspace summary so it no longer claims the web app is on stale Next.js 14 while `apps/web/package.json` uses Next 16.2.6. The change will be docs-only and verified by checking the stale text is gone and the manifest still declares the current version.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T12:06:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582770827","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESet7w","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Attempting scoped fix for notification creation unread-state override in #2010.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T12:11:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582780399","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESfK0g","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Attempting scoped fix for the API workspace test script failing before test discovery in #2014.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T12:15:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582787794","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESffUQ","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Attempting scoped fix for invalid job payload validation failing the request path instead of returning 400 in #2017.","cr