ananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582868084","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESkI3Q","author":{"login":"misakaAron"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"i think&nbsp; this PR is no money&nbsp; any more ！\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---Original---\r\nFrom: ***@***.***&gt;\r\nDate: Sat, May 30, 2026 20:45 PM\r\nTo: ***@***.***&gt;;\r\nCc: ***@***.******@***.***&gt;;\r\nSubject: Re: [SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty] Low Handing Fruit Automation (Issue #743)\r\n\r\n\r\nCeyvion left a comment (SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty#743)\r\n \r\nAttempting scoped fix for upload requests without a file returning HTTP 201 in #2054.\r\n \r\n—\r\nReply to this email directly, view it on GitHub, or unsubscribe.\r\nTriage notifications, keep track of coding agent tasks and review pull requests on the go with GitHub Mobile for iOS and Android. Download it today! \r\nYou are receiving this because you were mentioned.Message ID: ***@***.***&gt;","createdAt":"2026-05-30T12:49:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582869213","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESk6Ag","author":{"login":"chinook1001"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Accounting note for #743: these are my currently active low-hanging-fruit PRs, all scoped to separate issues and carrying the bounty-claim label.\n\n| PR | Issue | Scope | Latest validation |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| #1992 | #1990 | Server-owned `OPEN` status for new jobs | `node --test apps/api/src/tests/health.test.js apps/api/src/tests/jobService.test.js` |\n| #1996 | #1995 | Actionable dashboard/search navigation pages | `npm run build -w apps/web` |\n| #2002 | #2001 | Normalize payment currency codes | `node --test apps/api/src/tests/health.test.js apps/api/src/tests/paymentService.test.js` |\n| #2037 | #2034 | Require auth for job creation | `npm test -w apps/api` |\n| #2047 | #2046 | Require auth for message routes | `node --test apps/api/src/tests/health.test.js apps/api/src/tests/messageRoutes.test.js` |\n\nI refreshed these branches onto the latest `main` after the leaderboard updates; the PRs remain open and ready for review.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T12:54:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582881794","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESlBnQ","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Attempting scoped fix for rate-limit responses returning plain text instead of the API JSON failure envelope in #2061.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T12:55:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582883741","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESmIlg","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Attempting scoped fix: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/2064","createdAt":"2026-05-30T13:03:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582901910","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESmksA","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Attempting scoped fix: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/2067","createdAt":"2026-05-30T13:06:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582909104","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESm_bg","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Attempting scoped fix: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/2069","createdAt":"2026-05-30T13:10:08Z","in