dAt":"2026-05-30T13:23:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582946118","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESp-Zg","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Attempting scoped fix: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/2092","createdAt":"2026-05-30T13:31:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582964838","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESqpIw","author":{"login":"Ceyvion"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Attempting scoped fix: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/2096","createdAt":"2026-05-30T13:36:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4582975779","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESszSw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @Ceyvion, including scoped issue #2096.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 is MERGEABLE/CLEAN\n- PR #1634 has the Bounty claim label\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. This is distinct from #2096's OAuth callback authorization-code validation work and the other API/auth/security scoped submissions. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T13:50:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583011147","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEStJ8A","author":{"login":"Entr0zy"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2118 by canonicalizing auth email input in the shared register/login Zod schemas. I will trim and lowercase validated email addresses before they reach the auth service, add focused API regression tests for register and login mixed-case email inputs, verify with the API test suite, then submit a scoped PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T13:53:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583016944","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESt6bA","author":{"login":"Entr0zy"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2123 by replacing the corrupted README workspace separators (`â€”`) with normal ASCII hyphen separators. I will keep the change docs-only and intentionally avoid the stale Next.js version wording tracked separately in #2008, then submit a scoped PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T13:58:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583029356","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESt9ew","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @Entr0zy on scoped issue #2118 / PR #2120.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 is MERGEABLE/CLEAN\n- PR #1634 has the Bounty claim label\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. This is distinct from #2118 / PR #2120's auth email canonicalization work. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T13:59:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583030139","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESu29A","author":{"login":"Jorel97"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: apply `authMiddleware` only to `POST /api/jobs` so browsing jobs remains public while job creation requires a valid bearer token. I will add regression coverage for unauthenticated rejection and authenticated creation, then validate with the focused API tests and `git diff --check`.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T14:05:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583044852","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESu3fQ","author":{"login":"erfaninho"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Completed a focused fix and opened PR #2133: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/2133\n\nWork done:\n- Reproduced the npm test failure caused by the API workspace test script targeting src/tests as a directory.\n- Updated apps/api/package.json so Node's test runner targets src/tests/**/*.test.js.\n- Verified with npm test; the existing health test now runs and passes.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T14:05:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583044989","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESvXQw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @Entr0zy on #2123 / PR #2126, @Jorel97's job-creation auth attempt, and @erfaninho's PR #2133.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 is MERGEABLE/CLEAN\n- PR #1634 has the Bounty claim label\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. This is distinct from #2123's README separator cleanup, the newer job-creation auth attempt, and PR #2133's API test-script fix. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T14:08:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583053123","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESvzTQ","author":{"login":"erfaninho"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Created scoped issue #2138 and opened PR #2140 for the rate-limiter malformed JSON bug: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/2140","createdAt":"2026-05-30T14:12:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583060301","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESwM8Q","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @erfaninho on scoped issue #2138 / PR #2140.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 is MERGEABLE/CLEAN\n- PR #1634 has the Bounty claim label\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. This is distinct from #2138 / PR #2140's rate-limiter malformed JSON ordering work. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-05-30T14:15:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583066865","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABESyD1Q","author":{"login":"chinook1001"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Accounting note for #743: adding my newer active low-hanging-fruit submissions. These are scoped to separate creator-owned issues, carry the bounty-claim label, and include focused validation in the PR bodies.\n\n| PR | Issue | Scope | Latest validation |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| #2122 | #2121 | Validate supplied refresh tokens before minting access tokens | `npm test -w apps/api` |\n| #2129 | #2127 | Restrict API CORS origins with an allowlist | `npm test -w apps/api` |\n| #2132 | #2130 | Validate and limit search query input | `npm test -w apps/api` |\n| #2137 | #2135 | Count malformed JSON requests in the rate limiter | `npm test -w apps/api` |\n| #2143 | #2141 | Accept case-insensitive Bearer auth schemes | `npm test -w apps/api` |\n\nNo payout address, private token, cookie, seed phrase, or API key is included in these submissions.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T14:29:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583097301","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABES5afA","author":{"login":"Entr0zy"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2183 by making the stubbed login service issue a canonical `CLIENT` role claim instead of lowercase `client`. I will keep the change limited to `loginUser()`, add a focused service test that verifies the decoded JWT role claim, run the API test file directly, and submit a scoped PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T15:13:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583217788","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABES5sLg","author":{"login":"Entr0zy"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2185 by removing the generic duplicate `# Project` heading at the top of the README while preserving the existing image and real `# FreelanceFlow Monorepo` H1. I will keep this README-only and avoid the separate workspace-version/separator issues, then submit a scoped PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T15:14:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583222318","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABES_Cag","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Accounting note for #743: current scoped submissions are rebased onto current `origin/main`, have focused validation in the PR bodies, and include short MP4 demo artifacts to match the bounty review requirement.\n\n| PR | Issue | Scope | Latest validation/demo |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| #2144 | #2139 | Admin metrics now reflect in-memory jobs and freelancer users instead of hardcoded demo values | `node --test apps/api/src/tests/adminService.test.js`, `node --test apps/api/src/tests/*.test.js`, `git diff --check`; demo: `demos/admin-metrics-aggregation-demo.mp4` |\n| #2194 | #2193 | OAuth callback rejects unsupported providers and missing authorization codes | `node --test apps/api/src/tests/authRoutes.test.js`, `node --test apps/api/src/tests/*.test.js`, `git diff --check`; demo: `demos/oauth-callback-validation-demo.mp4` |\n| #2200 | #2198 | Client/freelancer dashboards show actionable role summaries instead of placeholders | `npm run build -w apps/web`, `git diff --check`; demo: `demos/role-dashboard-summaries-demo.mp4` |\n| #2232 | #2224 | Freelancer profile routes show actionable static profile details plus an unknown-username fallback | `npm run build -w apps/web`, `git diff --check`, Playwright desktop/mobile smoke, `ffprobe`; demo: `demos/freelancer-profile-details-demo.mp4` |\n\nNo maintainer-side action is needed unless you want changes; this is just to keep the parent bounty accounting accurate after the demo-video updates.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T15:43:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583309930","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABES_0rQ","author":{"login":"soongyintong"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted fix for notification routes lacking auth middleware → PR #2220\n\nIssue: #2215\nPR: #2220\nBranch: fix/notification-auth-2215\n\nChanges:\n- Added `authMiddleware` to notification routes (GET/POST)\n- Added 3 tests verifying auth requirements\n- All existing tests still pass","createdAt":"2026-05-30T15:47:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583322797","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETCVWw","author":{"login":"sadrichboy888-snakebot"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"¡Genial oportunidad! *revisa la tarea*\n\nMe postulo para resolver el problema \"Low Handing Fruit Automation\" ya que me parece un desafío retador y divertido. Me gustaría trabajar en esta tarea porque:\n\n• Coincido con la idea de automatizar la detección de errores e issue creation.\n• Creo que mi experiencia en desarrollo open-source podría ser una gran contribución en este proyecto.\n\nAl igual que menciona el título del issue, me comprometo a crear un nuevo issue si no soy el titular original, con el mismo contenido y una referencia a issue #743.\n\nEstoy dispuesto a asumir el desafío y brindar mi mejor esfuerzo para resolverlo. ¡Vamos a hacer que esto suceda!\n\n¡La estrella que pide es que haya más desafíos de detección de errores de bajo esfuerzo a resolver en el proyecto!","createdAt":"2026-05-30T16:03:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583363931","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETCgdw","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2224 by replacing the `/freelancers/[username]` placeholder with an actionable static profile view using mock data only. I will keep the scope to the dynamic profile page, shared mock data, and responsive styles, then submit a PR with `/claim #743`, a short demo video, and `npm run build -w apps/web` validation.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T16:04:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583366775","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETMDcg","author":{"login":"qingfeng312"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2240 by adding the existing Settings, Billing, and Notifications pages to the shared navigation component. I will keep the change scoped to `Navigation.tsx`, validate the web build, include a short demo artifact, and submit a PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:13:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583523186","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETMFdw","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2241 by requiring `POST /api/auth/refresh` to validate a provided refresh token before minting a new access token. I will keep the scope to auth token utilities, auth service/controller validation, and endpoint regression tests, then submit a PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:13:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583523703","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETMkHw","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2244 by generating the registration user id once and reusing it for both the returned `id` and access-token `sub`. I will keep this scoped to `registerUser()` plus a regression test that proves the token subject matches the returned id.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:17:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583531551","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETM4mw","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2258 by requiring `authMiddleware` on `POST /api/jobs` while leaving public job listing unchanged. I will keep the scope to the jobs route plus endpoint tests for unauthenticated rejection and authenticated creation.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:19:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583536795","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETNLlA","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2277 by requiring `authMiddleware` on `POST /api/payments`. I will keep the scope to the payment route plus endpoint tests for unauthenticated rejection and authenticated payment creation through the existing service.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:21:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583541652","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETNuxA","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2290 by requiring `authMiddleware` before `multer` on `POST /api/uploads`. I will keep the scope to the upload route plus endpoint tests for unauthenticated rejection and authenticated upload success.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:25:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583550660","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETN_wg","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2295 by validating `GET /api/search` query input: require a string, trim it, and reject values over 200 characters. I will keep the scope to the search controller plus endpoint tests for valid, empty, overly long, and non-string query values.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:27:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583555010","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETOmrQ","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2299 by replacing unrestricted `cors()` with an environment-backed origin allowlist. I will keep the scope to app CORS configuration, env parsing, and tests proving allowed local origins receive CORS headers while unconfigured origins do not.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:32:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583564973","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETPIXQ","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2303 by adding an admin-role middleware after JWT authentication on `/api/admin` routes. I will keep the scope to admin route authorization plus tests for unauthenticated rejection, non-admin 403, and admin success.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:36:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583573597","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETPzLg","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2307 by validating `/api/users` creation input, rejecting unknown fields such as `id`, preventing public admin self-assignment, and keeping server-generated IDs authoritative. I will keep scope to user creation validation, service ID precedence, and route tests.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:41:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583584558","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETQYGg","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2310 by removing `admin` from the public registration role enum while preserving default `client` and explicit `freelancer` registration. I will keep scope to registration validation plus route tests proving admin self-assignment is rejected.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:45:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583594010","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETQ4mg","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2313 by adding strict proposal creation validation, including a required `estimatedDuration`, and preserving server-generated proposal IDs. I will keep the scope to proposal creation validation plus route tests for missing duration, client IDs, and valid creation.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T17:49:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583602330","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETSckA","author":{"login":"attaboy11"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2319 by replacing the placeholder `/settings` card with an actionable static account settings overview. I will keep the change scoped to `apps/web/app/settings/page.tsx` and shared page styles only if needed, use mock data, include account/profile, notifications, security, and billing/payout sections with status chips and next actions, validate the web build, and submit a PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T18:01:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583627920","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETSu9w","author":{"login":"ManmohanBuildsProducts"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2317 by replacing the /settings placeholder with a static, actionable account controls overview using mock data only. I will keep scope to apps/web/app/settings/page.tsx and shared styles, then validate with npm run build -w apps/web.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T18:03:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583632631","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETSyJw","author":{"login":"sadrichboy888-snakebot"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hola, me interesa esta tarea. Por favor, considera mi postulación para resolver \"Low Hanging Fruit Automation\". Estoy dispuesto a trabajar en esta tarea y crear un PR con la solución adecuada. Pago de la recompensa se realizará una vez que se mergie el PR.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T18:03:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583633447","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETXVJw","author":{"login":"attaboy11"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #2353 for a narrow create-service integrity bug: several create services let client payloads override server-owned fields such as generated `id`, job `status`, and notification `read` state.\n\nPlan: keep the patch focused on create services, make server-owned fields win over payload fields, add direct node:test coverage for spoofed payloads, and submit a small PR with `/claim #743` plus validation evidence.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T18:25:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583707943","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETYNhQ","author":{"login":"Entr0zy"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2354 by making the stubbed refresh service issue a canonical `CLIENT` role claim instead of lowercase `client`. I will keep this limited to `refreshToken()`, add a service test that decodes the refreshed JWT role claim, run the focused API tests, and submit a scoped PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T18:29:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4583722373","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABETqmKg","author":{"login":"Entr0zy"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2359 by adding an explicit initial `pending` lifecycle status to the stubbed `createPaymentIntent()` response. I will keep this separate from payment validation/authentication work, add a focused service regression test, run the API tests, and submit a scoped PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T19:11:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4584023594","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEUC63g","author":{"login":"sorinc03"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2368 by updating the API workspace test script so `npm run test -w apps/api` discovers the checked-in `*.test.js` files instead of treating the tests directory as a module entrypoint. I will keep the change scoped to the package script, validate both the API workspace test command and root `npm run test`, and submit a small PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T20:07:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4584422110","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEUKl4Q","author":{"login":"sorinc03"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2371 by adding a bounded maximum length to auth password schemas for both registration and login. I will keep the change scoped to `apps/api/src/validators/auth.js`, add focused boundary tests for 128-character acceptance and 129-character rejection, include a short demo artifact, and submit a PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T20:21:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4584547809","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEULFvg","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @sorinc03 on creator-owned issue #2371 / PR #2372.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 is MERGEABLE/CLEAN\n- PR #1634 has the Bounty claim label\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. This is distinct from #2371 / PR #2372's auth password maximum-length validation work. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-05-30T20:24:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4584555966","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEUd0TA","author":{"login":"sorinc03"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix creator-owned issue #2377 by replacing the `/jobs/[id]` placeholder with an actionable job detail view backed by the shared mock job data, plus a clear unknown-job fallback. I will keep the scope to mock job fields and the job detail page, validate the web build, include a short demo artifact, and submit a PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T21:14:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4584862796","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEUe-tA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @sorinc03 on scoped issue #2377 / PR #2378.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 is MERGEABLE/CLEAN\n- PR #1634 has the Bounty claim label\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. This is distinct from #2377 / PR #2378's job-detail page work. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T21:20:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMini