issues/743#issuecomment-4584899732","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEUgKiA","author":{"login":"roblindsay24"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix my creator-owned issue #2382 by requiring the existing `authMiddleware` on `POST /api/messages` while leaving message listing behavior unchanged. I will keep the scope to `apps/api/src/routes/messageRoutes.js` plus focused endpoint tests proving unauthenticated message creation is rejected and authenticated creation still succeeds, then submit a PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T21:27:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4584901256","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEUhFpw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @roblindsay24 on creator-owned issue #2382.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- PR #1634 is mergeable/clean\n- PR #1634 has the Bounty claim label\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora reward link remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. This is distinct from #2382's `POST /api/messages` auth-middleware work. No contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T21:33:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4584916391","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEUi0kw","author":{"login":"rob