bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4589433408","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEY1W0Q","author":{"login":"LikeACloud7"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #3346 for creator-owned issue #3345: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/3346\n\nScope: review creation now returns a server-owned ISO createdAt timestamp and ignores caller-supplied createdAt values.\n\nValidation:\n- node --check apps/api/src/services/reviewService.js\n- node --check apps/api/src/tests/reviewService.test.js\n- node --test apps/api/src/tests/reviewService.test.js\n- node --test apps/api/src/tests/*.test.js\n- git diff --check","createdAt":"2026-06-01T04:03:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4589442769","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEY5iCg","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @LikeACloud7 on #3345 / PR #3346:\n- https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/3345\n- https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/3346\n- https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4589442769\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- Bounty claim label is present\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora claim remains Pending for USD 700: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. PR #3346 is a separate review creation server-owned createdAt timestamp slice. No contributor-side changes are pending on PR #1634 unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T04