sues/743#issuecomment-4589670546\n- Jorel97 PR #3215: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/3215\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- Bounty claim label is present\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora claim remains Pending for USD 700: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. The newer #743 comments/PRs are separate same-bounty activity. No contributor-side changes are pending on PR #1634 unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T05:05:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4589706355","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEZLScg","author":{"login":"vicentsmith470-web"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated creator-owned issue #3365 for malformed JSON requests bypassing the API rate limiter because `express.json()` runs before `apiLimiter`.\n\nPlan:\n- Move `apiLimiter` ahead of JSON body parsing in `createApp()`.\n- Add a focused regression test proving repeated malformed JSON requests eventually receive HTTP 429.\n- Keep scope limited to middleware ordering and rate-limit coverage; no JSON error formatting or route behavior changes.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T05:27:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4589802098","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEZMTBA","author":{"login":"vicentsmith470-web"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #3366 for creator-owned issue #3365:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/3366\n\nScope: malformed JSON requests now reach the global API limiter before body parsing, with a focused regression test proving the 201st malformed request receives HTTP 429.\n\nValidation:\n- `node --check apps/api/src/app.js`\n- `node --check apps/api/src/tests/rateLimit.test.js`\n- `node --test apps/api/src/tests/rateLimit.test.js`\n- `node --test apps/api/src/tests/health.test.js apps/api/src/tests/rateLimit.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`","createdAt":"2026-06-01T05:31:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4589818628","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEZPCFQ","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @vicentsmith470-web:\n- Latest issue activity: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4589818628\n- PR #3366: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/3366\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- Bounty claim label is present\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`, closes scoped issue #1632, and references #743\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora claim remains Pending for USD 700: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains the freelancer search mojibake separator UI fix with demo evidence and build validation. PR #3366 is separate same-bounty activity for malformed JSON rate limiting. No contributor-side changes are pending on PR #1634 unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T05:41:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4589863445","viewerDidAutho