 #3397 for a focused payment-intent data integrity bug: `createPaymentIntent()` drops the submitted `jobId`, leaving clients unable to associate the generated payment intent with the target job even though the Prisma `Payment` model requires `jobId`.\n\nPlan: return the submitted `jobId` from `apps/api/src/services/paymentService.js`, add focused service-level regression coverage, run the API test suite, and submit a small PR with `/claim #743` that closes #3397. No payout details or secrets will be posted publicly.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-01T09:03:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4591091208","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEad27A","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Reward-claim trace refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @AlonePenguin:\n- https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4591091208\n- Scoped issue referenced there: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/3397\n\nMy active reward claim for issue #743 remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent reward-readiness status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft\n- Bounty claim label is present\n- PR body includes `/claim #743`\n- `update-leaderboard` passed\n- Algora claim remains Pending for USD 700: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nThis is not WIP on my side; PR #1634 is a pending reward claim ready for maintainer review. Scope remains distinct: freelancer search skill separator fix, separate from the newer payment-intent jobId plan.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T09:12:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4591154924","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEbOvjA","