3 and validation evidence.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T18:36:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4595428094","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEelfJw","author":{"login":"EvidentLed"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #3516 for creator-owned issue #3515:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/3516\n\nScope: POST /api/auth/refresh now requires the existing auth middleware, and the refreshed token preserves the authenticated caller subject and role instead of minting a token for the hard-coded usr_existing client.\n\nVerification:\n- `npm run test -w apps/api` -> 3 tests passed\n- `git diff --check` -> passed\n\nDemo GIF:\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/EvidentLed/bug-bounty/a6240782dda6e824c538e7574974cd439bdc90ce/demo/auth-refresh-3515.gif\n\nCurrent PR status re-checked before this comment: open, non-draft, and bounty claim label present.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T18:42:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4595474215","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEelkcA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity from @danyili2632:\n- Latest attempt: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4595428094\n- Scoped issue: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/3517\n\nMy active #743 reward claim remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nRe-verified now: PR #1634 is open, non-draft, mergeable clean, includes `/claim #743`, `update-leaderboard` is successful, and Algora remains Pending for USD 700: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441","createdAt":"2026-06-01T18:42:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":fa