://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4595937582","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEfCOrA","author":{"login":"EvidentLed"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated creator-owned issue #3531 for the web TypeScript build-info artifact slice: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/3531\n\nPlan:\n- Add a scoped ignore rule for TypeScript build-info artifacts.\n- Verify the web TypeScript validation command still exits 0.\n- Verify the generated apps/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo artifact is ignored after the command runs.\n- Submit a scoped PR with /claim #743 and validation evidence.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T19:49:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4595945132","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEfEFBA","author":{"login":"EvidentLed"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #3532 for creator-owned issue #3531:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/3532\n\nScope: web TypeScript validation now treats generated tsbuildinfo files as ignored artifacts, so running the web tsc validation does not leave apps/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo as an untracked working-tree file.\n\nVerification:\n- Red check before the fix: tsc exited 0, then git status showed ?? apps/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo and git check-ignore returned 1.\n- After the fix: node node_modules/typescript/bin/tsc --noEmit -p apps/web/tsconfig.json -> exit 0.\n- After the fix: git status --ignored --short apps/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo -> !! apps/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo.\n- git diff --check -> passed.\n- node --test apps/api/src/tests/*.test.js -> 1 test passed.\n\nDemo GIF:\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/EvidentLed/bug-bounty/3434fe156477c10d1b23f22cb7e8a20710c46f26/demo/tsbuildinfo-3531.gif\n\nCurrent PR status re-checked before this comment: open, non-draft, bounty claim 