t submitted for a separate validation gap:\n\n- Issue: #4200\n- PR: #4201\n- Fix: caps job `skills` arrays at 20 entries while preserving the existing empty-array default.\n- Validation: `npm.cmd test -w apps/api` and `git diff --check`.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T01:28:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4618154351","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE0N3nA","author":{"login":"laughlife"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"#743 attempt submitted for a separate API security gap:\n\n- Issue: #4188\n- PR: #4199\n- Fix: restrict production CORS responses to origins listed in `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` while keeping development permissive when unset.\n- Validation: `npm test` and `git diff --check HEAD~1..HEAD`.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T01:28:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4618155932","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE0PwcA","author":{"login":"bozicovichsantiago20-oss"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Additional #743 attempt submitted for a separate message creation bug:\n\n- Issue: #4211\n- PR: #4213\n- Fix: preserves the server-generated message id when clients send an `id` field, while keeping `sentAt` server-owned.\n- Validation: `node --test apps/api/src/tests/message-service.test.js`, `node --test apps/api/src/tests/*.test.js`, and `git diff --check`.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T01:35:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4618186864","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE0P8ow","author":{"login":"laughlife"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Additional #743 attempt submitted for a separate review validation gap:\n\n- Issue: #4209\n- PR: #4214\n- Fix: rejects `POST /api/reviews` ratings outside the 1-5 integer range while preserving valid review creation.\n- Validation: red `node --test apps/api/src/tests/review.test.js` before fix, green `node --test apps/api/src/tests/*.test.js`, and `git diff --check HEAD~1..HEAD`.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T01:35:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4618189987","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE0Qjpw","author":{"login":"AxisIV"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated creator-owned issue #4217: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/4217\n\nPlan:\n- Keep message IDs server-owned by ensuring `sendMessage()` ignores client-supplied `id` values.\n- Preserve legitimate message payload fields and the server-generated `sentAt` timestamp.\n- Add a focused regression test proving a malicious payload ID cannot override the generated `msg_<timestamp>` ID.\n- Submit a scoped PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T01:37:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4618199975","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE0SD_g","author":{"login":"quantamShade0337"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreating a creator-owned scoped issue for a low-hanging API mass-assignment bug: job creation currently lets request bodies override server-owned `id` and initial `status`. Plan: create the scoped issue with the required #743 text, patch `createJob()` so server-owned fields are assigned after payload fields, add a regression test proving malicious `id`/`status` values are ignored, then submit a focused PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T01:43:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReas