dit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4623869227","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE5wT2A","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Short #743 visibility addendum after newer same-issue PR activity since my last refresh:\n\n- Newer external PR observed: @lcwLcw123 PR #4410: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4410\n- PR #4410 includes `/claim #743` and is currently open/clean.\n- My active #743 reward claim remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- Current PR #1634 status remains open, non-draft, clean, with `update-leaderboard` successful.\n\nKeeping this thread current so maintainers can attribute the active submitted claim cleanly.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T16:06:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4623963096","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE51Zlg","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Short #743 visibility addendum after newer same-issue PR activity since my last refresh:\n\n- Newer external PR observed: @lcwLcw123 PR #4418: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4418\n- PR #4418 includes `/claim #743` and is currently open/clean.\n- My active #743 reward claim remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- Current PR #1634 status remains open, non-draft, clean, with `update-leaderboard` successful.\n\nKeeping this thread current so maintainers can attribute the active submitted claim cleanly.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T16:17:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4624046486","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE6WkjQ","author":{"login":"sjj79475067-max"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: resolve creator-owned issue #4432 by making `POST /api/uploads` reject requests without `req.file` as `400 Bad Request`, while preserving successful multipart uploads as `201 Created`. I will keep the change limited to `uploadController` and add focused route-level regression tests for missing-file rejection plus a valid file upload.\n\nLocal validation already run before submission:\n- `node --test apps/api/src/tests/upload.test.js`\n- `node --test apps/api/src/tests/health.test.js`\n- `node --check apps/api/src/controllers/uploadController.js`\n- `node --check apps/api/src/tests/upload.test.js`\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-04T17:26:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4624589965","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE6YXmA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Short #743 visibility addendum after newer same-issue PR activity since my last refresh:\n\n- Newer external PR observed: @sjj79475067-max PR #4433: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4433\n- PR #4433 includes /claim #743 and is currently open/clean.\n- My active #743 reward claim remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- Current PR #1634 status remains open, non-draft, clean, bounty-labeled, with update-leaderboard successful.\n- Algora claim remains reachable and pending: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nKeeping this thread current so maintainers can attribute the active submitted claim cleanly.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T17:30:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4624619416","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE6-pjw","author":{"login":"henryle1"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: resolve my creator-owned reissue #4437 by making `/jobs/[id]` look up the selected mock job from `apps/web/lib/mock.ts`, render the matching title/budget/project context for known ids, and show a clear fallback for unknown ids. I will keep the change limited to the web job detail route and mock data shape, then validate with `npm run build -w apps/web` plus browser checks for a known and unknown job id.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:02:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625246607","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7BSyA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Short #743 visibility addendum after newer same-issue PR activity since my last refresh:\n\n- Newer external issue observed: @henryle1 issue #4437: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/4437\n- Newer external PR observed: @henryle1 PR #4439: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4439\n- PR #4439 includes `/claim #743` and is a separate creator-owned job-detail route fix.\n- My active #743 reward claim remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- Current PR #1634 status remains open, non-draft, clean, and bounty-labeled.\n- Algora claim remains reachable and pending: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nKeeping this thread current so maintainers can attribute the active submitted claim cleanly while reviewing the newer same-parent submission.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:09:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625289928","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7GPpA","author":{"login":"TSS99"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: resolve creator-owned issue #4447 by replacing the placeholder `apps/api/src/config/db.js` connection status with a guarded Prisma connection path. I will keep local tests independent of PostgreSQL by returning a skipped Prisma status when `DATABASE_URL` is absent, add focused regression tests for the skipped path and Prisma-client construction path, and keep the diff limited to the DB config/test surface.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:20:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625371044","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7JdhA","author":{"login":"anxovatomica"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"If anyone still needs this, I recently made **Free Invoice Generator**: https://anxovatomica.github.io/invoice-generator/\n\nCreate professional invoices in seconds — no signup, no watermarks, instant PDF download.\n\nFree, open-source, instant. No accounts or anything. Feel free to use it!","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:27:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625423748","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7JmZA","author":{"login":"anxovatomica"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hey! I built a free tool that might solve this exact problem: **Free Invoice Generator** — https://anxovatomica.github.io/invoice-generator/\n\nCreate professional invoices in seconds — no signup, no watermarks, instant PDF download.\n\nIt's completely free, no signup required, and works in the browser. Hope it helps! 🙌","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:28:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625426020","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7Jtgw","author":{"login":"anxovatomica"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hey! I built a free tool that might solve this exact problem: **Free Invoice Generator** — https://anxovatomica.github.io/invoice-generator/\n\nCreate professional invoices in seconds — no signup, no watermarks, instant PDF download.\n\nIt's completely free, no signup required, and works in the browser. Hope it helps! 🙌","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:28:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625427843","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7KGRg","author":{"login":"anxovatomica"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"If anyone still needs this, I recently made **Late Fee Calculator**: https://anxovatomica.github.io/late-fee-calc/\n\nCalculate late fees instantly. Enter amount, rate, and days overdue — get the exact fee breakdown.\n\nFree, open-source, instant. No accounts or anything. Feel free to use it!","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:29:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625434182","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7KOBw","author":{"login":"anxovatomica"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Here's a dead-simple solution: **Late Fee Calculator** (https://anxovatomica.github.io/late-fee-calc/)\n\nCalculate late fees instantly. Enter amount, rate, and days overdue — get the exact fee breakdown.\n\nBuilt it because I was tired of Excel formulas. Maybe it helps here too!","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:29:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625436167","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7LABw","author":{"login":"itosa-kazu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: resolve creator-owned issue #4456 by making `apps/api/src/server.js` export a testable bootstrap helper, auto-start only when run directly, and catch startup failures with a clear error plus non-zero exit code. I will keep the change scoped to API startup handling and add focused node:test coverage for import side effects and rejected startup dependencies.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:31:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625448967","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7NJgg","author":{"login":"anxovatomica"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Just wanted to share a workaround I found useful: **Free Invoice Generator** (https://anxovatomica.github.io/invoice-generator/)\n\nCreate professional invoices in seconds — no signup, no watermarks, instant PDF download.\n\nMight save you some time if you're looking for a quick solution!","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:36:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625484162","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7OLBw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Short #743 visibility refresh after newer same-issue activity since my last refresh:\n\n- Newer external PR observed: @TSS99 PR #4449: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4449\n- Newer external issue observed: @itosa-kazu issue #4456: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/4456\n- Newer external PR observed: @itosa-kazu PR #4458: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4458\n- My active submitted #743 reward claim remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- PR #1634 remains open, non-draft, bounty-labeled, includes `/claim #743`, and GitHub currently reports `CLEAN` with `update-leaderboard` successful.\n- Algora claim remains reachable and pending: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nKeeping this attribution trail current for maintainer review while the newer same-parent submissions are reviewed.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:39:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625500935","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7OSJg","author":{"login":"tudorian95"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"﻿/attempt #743\n\nPlan: resolve creator-owned issue #4459 by replacing the `@freelanceflow/ui` package entrypoint with a Node-loadable JavaScript module, adding declaration metadata for `Button` and `Card`, and adding a focused import regression test that proves `import(\"@freelanceflow/ui\")` works from the workspace package name. I will keep the change scoped to the UI workspace package and validation evidence.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:39:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625502758","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7T68A","author":{"login":"itosa-kazu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\\n\\nScoped creator-owned issue: #4463\\n\\nPlan: add a bounded proposal lifecycle status, default new proposals to a server-owned pending state, prevent payload status override, and include focused regression tests.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T19:53:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625595120","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7W-8Q","author":{"login":"itosa-kazu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\\n\\nScoped creator-owned issue: #4465\\n\\nPlan: add a (jobId, freelancerId) uniqueness constraint for proposals, reject duplicate in-memory proposal creation with 409 Conflict, and add focused regression tests.","createdAt":"2026-06-04T20:00:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625645297","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7bctw","author":{"login":"tudorian95"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"﻿/attempt #743\n\nPlan: resolve creator-owned issue #4467 by moving `GET /health` ahead of the global API rate limiter, leaving all API routes behind `apiLimiter`, and adding a focused regression test that exhausts the limiter count against `/health` while still receiving the normal health payload.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-04T20:10:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625718455","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7exqw","author":{"login":"tudorian95"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"﻿/attempt #743\n\nPlan: resolve creator-owned issue #4469 by validating OAuth callback provider names and requiring a non-empty authorization code before returning success. I will keep the change scoped to `authController` and add focused route tests for unsupported provider, missing/blank code, and the valid GitHub callback path.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-04T20:18:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625772971","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7hsIA","author":{"login":"sadrichboy888-snakebot"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"\"¡Hola equipo! Me gustaría postularme para resolver este desafiante reto de automatizar la detección y creación de issues relacionadas con el 'Low Hanging Fruit'. Mi objetivo es crear un sistema eficiente que pueda ser utilizado de manera recursiva, mejorando la eficiencia en la detección y resolución de bugs. Estaré encantado de trabajar en este proyecto y aportar mi experiencia en el campo del desarrollo. Mi presupuesto para el reto asciende a los 700 dólares. ¿Cuál es el siguiente paso para comenzar el trabajo?.\"","createdAt":"2026-06-04T20:25:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625820704","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7jlKw","author":{"login":"sjj79475067-max"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: resolve creator-owned issue #4471 by normalizing payment currency codes in `createPaymentIntent`. The fix trims surrounding whitespace and lowercases supplied string currency values while preserving the current missing-currency default of `usd`. I kept the diff limited to the payment service and added route-level tests for the default and `\" USD \"` normalization paths.\n\nSubmitted PR: #4472\n\nLocal validation:\n- `node --test apps/api/src/tests/payment.test.js`\n- `node --test apps/api/src/tests/health.test.js`\n- `node --check apps/api/src/services/paymentService.js`\n- `node --check apps/api/src/tests/payment.test.js`","createdAt":"2026-06-04T20:30:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625851691","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7kpSw","author":{"login":"sjj79475067-max"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: resolve creator-owned issue #4473 by adding the initial Stripe-style `requires_payment_method` lifecycle status to new payment intent responses. The change stays limited to `createPaymentIntent` and includes route-level regression coverage for the returned status.\n\nSubmitted PR: #4474\n\nLocal validation:\n- `node --test apps/api/src/tests/paymentStatus.test.js`\n- `node --test apps/api/src/tests/health.test.js`\n- `node --check apps/api/src/services/paymentService.js`\n- `node --check apps/api/src/tests/paymentStatus.test.js`","createdAt":"2026-06-04T20:33:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625869131","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7mJ-A","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Short #743 visibility refresh after newer same-issue submitted PR activity:\n\n- Newer external issue observed: @sjj79475067-max issue #4473: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/4473\n- Newer external PR observed: @sjj79475067-max PR #4474: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4474\n- PR #4474 includes `/claim #743` and is currently open, non-draft, CLEAN, and bounty-labeled.\n- My active submitted #743 reward claim remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- Current PR #1634 status remains open, non-draft, CLEAN, bounty-labeled, includes `/claim #743`, and has successful `update-leaderboard`.\n- Algora claim remains reachable and pending: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nPlease keep my existing #743 submission and claim in the reward review set while reviewing the newer same-parent submission.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-04T20:36:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625893880","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7n5XA","author":{"login":"tudorian95"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"﻿/attempt #743\n\nPlan: resolve creator-owned issue #4477 by returning the API limiter's 429s through the existing JSON `fail()` helper, with a focused regression test showing the 201st limited request now returns a structured JSON error payload.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-04T20:40:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625922396","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7sbwg","author":{"login":"AxisIV"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped creator-owned issue: #4479\n\nPlan completed: keep notification creation's initial unread state server-owned by forcing \read: false after payload spread, add a focused POST /api/notifications regression test for a payload attempting \read: true, and submit PR #4480 with /claim #743 plus demo and validation evidence.\n\nSubmitted PR: #4480","createdAt":"2026-06-04T20:50:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4625996738","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABE7tvEQ","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Short #743 visibility refresh after newer same-issue submitted PR activity:\n\n- Newer external issue observed: @AxisIV issue #4479: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/4479\n- Newer external PR observed: @AxisIV PR #4480: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4480\n- PR #4480 includes `/claim #743` and is currently open, non-draft, CLEAN, bounty-labeled, with successful `update-leaderboard`.\n- My active submitted #743 reward claim remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- Current PR #1634 status remains open, non-draft, bounty-labeled, includes `/claim #743`, and has successful `update-leaderboard`; GitHub currently reports merge state `UNKNOWN` on this refresh.\n- Algora claim remains reachable and pending: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nPlease keep my 