sponses. I will keep the PR scoped to upload middleware/error handling plus regression tests.","createdAt":"2026-06-05T17:07:55Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4633769087","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFDIR-Q","author":{"login":"catcherintheroad-hub"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #4891\n\nSubmitted PR #4895 with `/claim #743`: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4895\n\nScope:\n- add search and category filtering to `/jobs`\n- show matching job count, visible budget, and active filter summary\n- surface skills/category metadata on job cards\n- keep detail links and add a listing-level Post Job action\n\nValidation:\n- `PATH=/opt/homebrew/opt/node@22/bin:$PATH npm run build -w apps/web`\n- `git diff --check`\n- demo MP4: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/catcherintheroad-hub/bug-bounty-earn-1000/codex/job-listing-triage-4891/demos/job-listing-triage-4891.mp4\n\nNo payout address, private token, cookie, seed phrase, or API key is included.","createdAt":"2026-06-05T17:11:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4633793017","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFDKaLw","author":{"login":"bnpl7"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #4897\n\nFix plan: add an explicit JSON body size limit to the Express parser and map oversized parser failures to a clear client error. I will keep the PR scoped to app-level JSON parser behavior plus regression tests for oversized and normal JSON payloads.","createdAt":"2026-06-05T17:16:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issue