rc/tests/health.test.js` passed.\n- #4205 Fix registration token subject: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4205\n  - Demo: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yZangEren/bug-bounty/fix-register-token-subject/demos/register-token-subject-demo.mp4\n  - Validation: `node --test src/tests/auth.test.js src/tests/health.test.js` passed.\n- #4197 Return 400 for invalid validated payloads: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4197\n  - Demo: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yZangEren/bug-bounty/fix-zod-validation-response/demos/zod-validation-response-demo.mp4\n  - Validation: `node --test src/tests/validation.test.js src/tests/health.test.js` passed.\n- #4185 Fix notification server-owned fields: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4185\n  - Demo: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yZangEren/bug-bounty/fix-notification-server-owned-state/demos/notification-server-owned-state-demo.mp4\n  - Validation: `node --test src/tests/notification.test.js src/tests/health.test.js` passed.\n- #4161 Validate payment creation payloads: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4161\n  - Demo: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yZangEren/bug-bounty/fix-payment-intent-validation/demos/payment-intent-validation-demo.mp4\n  - Validation: `node --test src/tests/payment.test.js src/tests/health.test.js` passed 5 tests.\n- #4154 Add actionable settings overview: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4154\n  - Demo: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yZangEren/bug-bounty/fix-settings-account-controls/demos/settings-account-controls-demo.mp4\n  - Validation: `npm run build -w apps/web` passed.\n- #4142 Resolve mock jobs in detail route: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4142\n  - Demo: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yZangEren/bug-bounty/fix-job-detail-lookup/demos/job-detail-lookup-demo.mp4\n  - Validation: `npm run build -w apps/web` passed.\n- #4133 Validate job budget ranges: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4133\n  - Demo: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yZangEren/bug-bounty/fix-job-budget-range-validation/demos/job-budget-range-validation-demo.mp4\n  - Validation: `npm test` passed 5 tests.\n\nThe Algora claim currently linked for my #743 submission is still pending/reachable: https://algora.io/claims/ecTkfmGQ63K8RjwZ\n\nNo payout address, private token, cookie, seed phrase, or API key is included.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-05T17:44:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4634033083","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFDwnBQ","author":{"login":"hapwi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #4911\n\nFix plan: replace the `/billing` placeholder with a static invoice and payout overview using mock data only. The page will surface balance, pending escrow, next payout, representative invoice rows, payout method readiness, and recent transaction history while staying scoped to `apps/web/app/billing/page.tsx` with no API or payment-provider changes.\n\nPayout route if accepted: Base USDC 0x5d8a819bd8d056119626c34b384739ab15505093","createdAt":"2026-06-05T18:41:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4634453765","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFDzgMg","author":{"login":"hapwi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #4913\n\nFix plan: replace the `/messaging` placeholder with a static, actionable inbox workspace using mock data only. The page will show unread/response summary metrics, representative thread rows, a selected conversation preview, and reply/next-action controls while staying scoped to `apps/web/app/messaging/page.tsx` with no API, auth, persistence, or real-time messaging ch