 and has a reachable pending Algora claim. Please keep the active submissions in the #743 reward review set while reviewing these newer same-parent submissions.","createdAt":"2026-06-05T19:42:06Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4634909906","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFEP2qg","author":{"login":"hapwi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #4957\n\nI am working on making `@freelanceflow/ui` directly importable by adding runtime JavaScript entrypoints while preserving TypeScript declarations.","createdAt":"2026-06-05T19:49:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4634965674","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFEQqBg","author":{"login":"hapwi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #4961\n\nI am working on preventing public registration from self-assigning the admin role while preserving client/freelancer registration.","createdAt":"2026-06-05T19:51:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4634978822","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFERXuQ","author":{"login":"hapwi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #4965\n\nI am working on rejecting inverted job budget ranges in create and update validation while preserving valid partial updates.","createdAt":"2026-06-05T19:52:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4634990521","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFEUEeQ","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Additional #743 visibility refresh after newer same-parent submitted PRs by @hapwi:\n\n- PR #4960 / scoped issue #4957: open, non-draft, has the Bounty claim label, includes `/claim #743`, and `update-leaderboard` is SUCCESS.\n- PR #4962 / scoped issue #4961: open, non-draft, has the Bounty claim label, includes `/claim #743`, and `update-leaderboard` is SUCCESS.\n- PR #4966 / scoped issue #4965: open, non-draft, has the Bounty claim label, includes `/claim #743`, and `update-leaderboard` is SUCCESS.\n\nMy active #743 submission remains PR #1634: open, non-draft, has the Bounty claim label, includes `/claim #743`, and `update-leaderboard` is SUCCESS. Please keep PR #1634 in the active #743 reward review set while reviewing these newer same-parent submissions.","createdAt":"2026-06-05T19:59:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4635034745","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFFXebQ","author":{"login":"alejandrorivas-pixel"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped creator-owned issue: #5043\n\nPlan: reject whitespace-only passwords in the shared auth password schema used by registration and login, preserve the existing minimum length rule for real passwords, and add focused validator regression tests for register/login blank-password payloads.","createdAt":"2026-06-05T22:40:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4636139117","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFFgvdQ","author":{"login":"alejandrorivas-pixel"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped creator-owned issue: #5045\n\nPlan: generate the registered user id once in `registerUser`, sign the access token with that same id as `sub`, and add a focused service regression test that forces `Date.now()` to advance between calls while asserting the returned id and decoded token subject stay aligned.","createdAt":"2026-06-05T23:09:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4636290933","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFFwlfQ","author":{"login":"Plasmarine"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #5066\n\nFix plan: require and preserve `clientId` in the job creation validator so created jobs can be associated with the posting client, and add focused regression tests showing valid payloads keep `clientId` while missing/blank client owners are rejected.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T00:14:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4636550525","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFFx6GA","author":{"login":"Plasmarine"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #5068\n\nFix plan: add a focused `build` script for `@freelanceflow/ui` backed by a package TypeScript config so the shared UI components can be validated independently, then run the UI build and web build to confirm the package and consumer still compile.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T00:20:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4636572184","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFF000w","author":{"login":"Plasmarine"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5077\n\nPlan:\n- Add a package-level `build` script for `@freelanceflow/db` that validates the Prisma schema by generating the Prisma client.\n- Verify `npm run build -w packages/db` succeeds.\n- Keep the change limited to DB workspace package metadata and include a short demo MP4 in the PR.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T00:34:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4636619987","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGDQOw","author":{"login":"yZangEren"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #5082\n\nFix plan: add a package-level TypeScript build/typecheck script for `packages/ui` with a minimal package-local `tsconfig.json`, then verify `npm run build -w packages/ui`, `npm run build -w apps/web`, and `git diff --check`.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T01:36:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4636856379","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGGPGA","author":{"login":"alejandrorivas-pixel"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped creator-owned issue: #5084\n\nPlan: require and preserve a non-empty `clientId` in `createJobSchema` so job creation payloads match the required Prisma `Job.clientId` relation, and add focused validator regression tests for valid, missing, and blank client owner ids. Implementation submitted in PR #5085.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T01:50:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4636905240","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGPEcA","author":{"login":"lemon1732"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped creator-owned issue: #5097\n\nPlan: preserve server-owned user creation fields by ignoring caller-provided `id` and `isVerified`, defaulting new users to `isVerified: false`, and adding focused API regression coverage that proves `POST /api/users` cannot create a spoofed id or pre-verified user.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T02:26:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637049968","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGZTJQ","author":{"login":"beautifullantern"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5114 for a current in-memory service isolation bug: list helpers expose backing store arrays/records and create helpers retain nested payload references. Plan: add defensive snapshot helpers, update the affected in-memory services, and add focused node:test coverage proving returned arrays/records and original payload arrays cannot mutate internal state. Payment details are not posted publicly.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T03:22:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637217573","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGZ0vQ","author":{"login":"beautifullantern"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5116 for a current upload authorization bug: `POST /api/uploads` accepts multipart uploads without `authMiddleware`, so unauthenticated requests can reach memory-backed file parsing. Plan: apply auth before `upload.single(\"file\")` and add focused route tests for missing bearer credentials and valid authenticated uploads. Payment details are not posted publicly.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T03:27:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637226173","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGaRAg","author":{"login":"beautifullantern"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5118 for a current admin authorization bug: `/api/admin/metrics` checks for any valid bearer token but does not require the decoded role to be `admin`. Plan: add an admin role guard after authentication, preserve existing 401 behavior for missing/invalid credentials, return 403 for non-admin roles, and add focused route tests. Payment details are not posted publicly.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T03:30:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637233410","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGaymw","author":{"login":"beautifullantern"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5120 for a current payment validation bug: `POST /api/payments` passes raw request bodies to payment intent creation, allowing missing, non-numeric, zero, negative, non-finite amounts, and unsupported currencies. Plan: add a focused payment schema, return 400 for invalid payloads, preserve the default USD behavior for valid payloads, and add route regression tests. Payment details are not posted publicly.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T03:34:55Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637242011","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGbVqA","author":{"login":"beautifullantern"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5122 for a current message privacy bug: `GET /api/messages` lists the message store without `authMiddleware`. Plan: protect only message-list reads with bearer authentication, preserve the existing authenticated success shape, and add focused route tests for unauthenticated and authenticated list requests. Payment details are not posted publicly.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T03:38:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637250984","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGb-YA","author":{"login":"beautifullantern"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix scoped issue #5130 by requiring the existing bearer auth middleware on GET /api/reviews, add regression coverage for unauthenticated and authenticated reads, then submit a PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T03:44:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637261408","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGcgKw","author":{"login":"elianguitarra"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5132 for a current job validation bug: create/update job schemas accept inverted budget ranges where budgetMax is lower than budgetMin. Plan: add a shared zod refinement to reject inverted ranges while allowing partial updates unless both fields are present, add direct validator tests, and submit a focused PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T03:48:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637270059","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGclbw","author":{"login":"beautifullantern"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix scoped issue #5133 by requiring the existing bearer auth middleware on the notification route group, add tests for unauthenticated rejection and authenticated access, then submit a PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T03:48:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637271407","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGc-6w","author":{"login":"beautifullantern"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix scoped issue #5136 by requiring the existing bearer auth middleware on the proposal route group, add tests for unauthenticated rejection and authenticated access, then submit a PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T03:51:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637277931","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGdrSw","author":{"login":"beautifullantern"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: fix scoped issue #5138 by validating GET /api/search q as a single bounded string, rejecting repeated/object-shaped and oversized values, adding regression tests, then submitting a PR with /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T03:55:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637289291","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGp8kA","author":{"login":"catcherintheroad-hub"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5155 for the health-check rate-limit bypass problem. Plan: move `/health` before the shared API limiter, keep `/api/*` throttling intact, add regression coverage proving API requests can hit 429 while `/health` still returns 200, then submit a focused PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T05:13:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637490320","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGqnOg","author":{"login":"catcherintheroad-hub"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5157 for the rate-limit JSON error response problem. Plan: configure the shared API limiter to return the same `{ success: false, message: ... }` envelope used by other API errors, add focused regression coverage for 429 JSON responses, then submit a focused PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T05:18:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637501242","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFGra1A","author":{"login":"catcherintheroad-hub"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5159 for shared rate-limit state between `createApp()` instances. Plan: turn the shared API limiter singleton into a per-app factory, keep the existing limiter settings unchanged, add regression coverage proving a fresh app instance is not rate-limited by requests sent to a previous app instance, then submit a focused PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T05:23:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4637514452","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFHLGtQ","author":{"login":"alan747271363-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #5174\n\nFix plan: keep notification id and initial \read: false server-owned by moving caller payload before the server-owned fields, then add a focused service regression test proving caller-supplied id/\read cannot override them.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T08:57:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4638033589","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFHL-tA","author":{"login":"alan747271363-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #5176\n\nFix plan