88AAAABFHOjNw","author":{"login":"alan747271363-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #5198\n\nFix plan: make listMessages() return cloned message records instead of the mutable backing array, with a focused regression test for array and object mutation.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T09:20:06Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4638090039","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFHOz5g","author":{"login":"alan747271363-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #5200\n\nFix plan: make listNotifications() return cloned notification records instead of the mutable backing array, with a focused regression test for array and object mutation.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T09:21:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4638094310","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFHPW_g","author":{"login":"alan747271363-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #5208\n\nFix plan: return a cloned user object from createUser() after storing the internal record, with a focused regression test that mutating the returned object does not mutate listUsers() output.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T09:24:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4638103294","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFHPi_Q","author":{"login":"alan747271363-art"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #5211\n\nFix plan: return a cloned job object from createJob() after storing the internal record, with a focused regression test that mutating the returned object does not mutate listJobs() output.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T09:25:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4638106365","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFHTlKA","author":{"login":"aip1996"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan:\n- Create a scoped issue for the refresh endpoint token-validation bug.\n- Require a token in POST /api/auth/refresh requests.\n- Verify the supplied token before minting a replacement access token.\n- Preserve the verified sub and role in the replacement token.\n- Add regression tests for missing, invalid, and valid refresh token requests.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T09:51:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4638172456","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFHf5iw","author":{"login":"seekynn"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: create a scoped issue for a non-duplicate auth parser bug I reproduced locally: `Authorization: Bearer  <valid-token>` fails because the middleware slices after exactly one space instead of accepting the RFC 6750 `1*SP` separator. I will add a focused failing API test, update only token extraction to accept one or more spaces after `Bearer`, verify the targeted suite, and submit a narrow PR with the scoped issue linked.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T11:32:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4638374283","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFHpdHg","author":{"login":"wowsofine"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5268 for the current placeholder database connection in `apps/api/src/config/db.js`. Plan: replace the `prisma-placeholder` path with focused Prisma-backed connection behavior, add a regression test for the DB config module, validate the API test suite and diff hygiene, then submit a narrow PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T12:17:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4638530846","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFHqZzg","author":{"login":"wowsofine"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5270 for a narrow API routing bug: known API collection routes such as `PUT /api/jobs` fall through to Express HTML 404 instead of returning a structured JSON 405 method-not-allowed response. Plan: add a focused failing route test, add a small method-not-allowed helper with `Allow` headers, apply it only to known API collection routes, validate supported methods remain unchanged, then submit a narrow PR with `/claim #743`.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T12:22:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4638546382","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFIVHrg","author":{"login":"chedger"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nCreated scoped issue #5283 for a keyboard accessibility bug: the web layout lacks a skip link to page-specific content after the shared navigation. Plan: add a visible-on-focus skip link before the repeated layout content, target a focusable page-content wrapper after the navigation, keep the existing navigation/main structure unchanged to avoid overlapping the main-landmark issue, validate diff hygiene, and submit a focused PR with `/claim #743`.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T14:39:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4639246254","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFIbbIA","author":{"login":"NiXouuuu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"[Codex GPT-5] /attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #3322. PR: #5288.\n\nPlan executed: add a server-owned ISO createdAt timestamp in apps/api/src/services/jobService.js when createJob creates a job, preserve the same timestamp in the returned and stored in-memory record, and add focused Node test coverage proving caller-supplied createdAt cannot override the server-owned value.\n\nValidation completed: node --test apps/api/src/tests/*.js; node --check apps/api/src/services/jobService.js; node --check apps/api/src/tests/jobService.test.js; git diff --check.\n\nPayment details are not posted publicly.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T15:05:55Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4639349536","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFIbvlQ","author":{"login":"NiXouuuu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"[Codex GPT-5] /attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #3324.\n\nPlan: add a server-owned ISO createdAt timestamp in apps/api/src/services/paymentService.js when createPaymentIntent creates a payment intent response, preserve existing amount/currency/provider behavior, add focused Node service tests for timestamp format and default currency behavior, then submit a narrow PR with /claim #743.\n\nPayment details are not posted publicly.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T15:07:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4639354773","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFIcgqw","author":{"login":"NiXouuuu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"[Codex GPT-5] /attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #3627.\n\nPlan: restrict public registration roles in apps/api/src/validators/auth.js to client and freelancer only, preserve the default client role and valid public role behavior, add focused validator regression tests proving admin role registration is rejected, then submit a narrow PR with /claim #743.\n\nPayment details are not posted publicly.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T15:10:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4639367339","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFId1gg","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Short visibility refresh after newer same-issue #743 activity since my last note:\n\n- Newer external submitted PR observed: @NiXouuuu PR #5288: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/5288\n- PR #5288 is open, non-draft, bounty-labeled, includes `/claim #743`, and its `update-leaderboard` check is passing.\n- My active #743 reward submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- Current PR #1634 state rechecked: open, non-draft, bounty-labeled, includes `/claim #743`, and its `update-leaderboard` check is passing.\n- Algora already lists my #743 row as a reward claim for PR #1634: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nPlease keep my earlier submitted #743 claim in the maintainer reward review set while reviewing the newer same-issue submission.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T15:17:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4639389058","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFIpLuQ","author":{"login":"catcherintheroad-hub"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Maintainer review request for a narrow submitted #743 rate-limit set from @catcherintheroad-hub:\n\n- #5156 Let health checks bypass API rate limiting\n- #5158 Return JSON from API rate limiter\n- #5160 Isolate API rate limiter per app instance\n\nAll three are open, non-draft, CLEAN/mergeable, include /claim #743, have the bounty claim label, and have successful update-leaderboard checks. Each PR includes focused regression coverage plus a full API test run and git diff check.\n\nCould a maintainer please review these for acceptance/reward decision, or point to the exact blocker if one remains? I can revise quickly.","createdAt":"2026-06-06T15:59:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4639574969","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFIpl6w","author":{"login":"NiXouuuu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"[Codex GPT-5] /attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5292.\n\nPlan: add a focused JSON 405 fallback for known API collection routes such as `/api/jobs`, using the existing `{ success: false, message: ... }` response envelope and an `Allow` header, while keeping supported methods unchanged. Add Node test coverage for unsupported method behavior and validate the API tests plus diff hygiene before opening a narrow PR with `/claim #743`.\n\nPayment details are not posted publicly.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-06T16:00:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4639581675","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFIqwHA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Latest-tail refresh after newer same-bounty #743 activity including PR #5156 and scoped issue #5292.\n\nActive #743 submissions from this account remain open, non-draft, and CLEAN, including:\n- PR #1634 — freelancer search separator fix, `/claim #743`, closes #1632, references #743\n- PR #4511 — preserve generated user ids, `/claim #743`, closes #4510\n- PR #4515 — avoid exposing submitted user passwords, `