k SUCCESS. This remains the focused freelancer search separator fix submitted for the same #743 low-hanging-fruit lane.\n- PR #4511: OPEN, non-draft, MERGEABLE, bounty-claim label present, `/claim #743` in PR body, update-leaderboard check SUCCESS. This remains the focused server-generated user-id preservation fix.\n\nAt this refresh, competing PRs #5520/#5524/#5526 are OPEN with mergeability UNKNOWN, and #5528 was still running update-leaderboard. No contributor-side WIP is pending from our side unless maintainers request revisions. Please review the already-submitted claim-protected PRs on technical merit.\n\n/claim #743\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-08T00:44:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4644628253","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFNdtow","author":{"login":"avantikau"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nEvidence update for scoped issue #5527 / PR #5528:\n- PR: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/5528\n- Demo video: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/avantikau/bug-bounty/codex/json-404-5527/demo-artifacts/issue-5527-json-404-demo.mp4\n- Verification remains green locally: `node --test src/tests/health.test.js` from `apps/api`, plus syntax checks and `git diff --check`.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T00:45:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4644629923","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFNeWPw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Tail refresh after @avantikau posted `/claim #743` at 2026-06-08T00:45:26Z following PR #5528.\n\nOur active #743 submissions remain PR #1634 and PR #4511. Both are OPEN, non-draft, MERGEABLE, have the bounty-claim label, include `/claim #743` in the PR body, and have update-lead