1780883870/demo-artifacts/issue-5543-bearer-spacing-demo.mp4\n\nVerification:\n- node --test src/tests/*.test.js from apps/api\n- node --check apps/api/src/middleware/auth.js\n- node --check apps/api/src/tests/auth.test.js\n- node --check apps/api/src/tests/health.test.js\n- git diff --check\n\nPayment details can be provided privately after maintainer acceptance.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T02:02:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4644875028","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFNtSxA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Tail refresh after newer #743 same-bounty activity from @sh962214-hub at 2026-06-08T01:44:41Z / scoped issue #5541 / PR #5542.\n\nMy active #743 submissions remain PR #1634 and PR #4511:\n- PR #1634: OPEN, non-draft, MERGEABLE, bounty-claim label present, `/claim #743` in PR body, update-leaderboard check SUCCESS. This remains the focused freelancer search separator fix submitted for the same #743 low-hanging-fruit lane.\n- PR #4511: OPEN, non-draft, MERGEABLE, bounty-claim label present, `/claim #743` in PR body, update-leaderboard check SUCCESS. This remains the focused server-generated user-id preservation fix.\n\nLatest competing same-bounty PR #5542 is OPEN, non-draft, MERGEABLE, claim-labeled, and update-leaderboard SUCCESS. No contributor-side WIP is pending from my side unless maintainers request revisions. Please keep PR #1634 and PR #4511 in review for #743 payout consideration on technical merit.\n\n/claim #743","createdAt":"2026-06-08T02:06:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4644885188","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFNumOw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Tail refresh correction after the latest #743 same-bounty activity cluster:\n- @sh962214-hub scoped issue #5541 / PR #5542 at 2026-06-08T01:44Z\n- @avantikau scoped issue #5543 / PR #5545 at 2026-06-08T02:02Z\n\nMy active #743 submissions remain PR #1634 and PR #4511:\n- PR #1634: OPEN, non-draft, MERGEABLE, bounty-claim label present, `/claim #743` in PR body, update-leaderboard check SUCCESS. This remains the focused freelancer search separator fix submitted for the same #743 low-hanging-fruit lane.\n- PR #4511: OPEN, non-draft, MERGEABLE, bounty-claim label present, `/claim #743` in PR body, update-leaderboard check SUCCESS. This remains the focused server-generated user-id preservation fix.\n\nLatest competing same-bounty PRs #5542 and #5545 are OPEN, non-draft, MERGEABLE, claim-labeled, and have update-leaderboard SUCCESS. No contributor-side WIP is pending from my side unless maintainers request revisions. Please keep PR #1634 and PR #4511 in review for #743 payout consideration on technical merit.\n\n/claim #743","createdAt":"2026-06-08T02:12:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4644906555","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOAWwA","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5567\n\nPlan: add a focused review payload validator so `POST /api/reviews` rejects ratings outside the 1-5 range before calling the in-memory service, return a 400 with a clear validation message, add regression API tests for invalid and valid ratings, and attach a short demo video in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:34:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645197504","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOAcXA","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5577\n\nPlan: add a focused proposal payload validator so `POST /api/proposals` rejects zero, negative, and non-numeric `bidAmount` values before calling the in-memory service, return a 400 with a clear validation message, add regression API tests for invalid and valid bids, and attach a short demo video in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:35:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645198940","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOAi-g","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nScoped issue: #5567\nPR: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/5572\n\nSummary: `POST /api/reviews` now validates the review payload before creating an in-memory review, rejects ratings outside the 1-5 range with a 400 response, and keeps valid review creation working.\n\nDemo video: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dallasnetprofu02-design/bug-bounty/demo-artifacts/demo-artifacts/issue-5567-review-validation-demo.mp4\n\nVerification:\n- node --test src/tests/*.js from apps/api\n- node --check src/controllers/reviewController.js\n- node --check src/validators/review.js\n- git diff --check","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:35:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645200634","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOAlTA","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nScoped issue: #5577\nPR: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/5579\n\nSummary: `POST /api/proposals` now validates the proposal payload before creating an in-memory proposal, rejects zero, negative, and non-numeric `bidAmount` values with a 400 response, and keeps valid positive bids working.\n\nDemo video: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dallasnetprofu02-design/bug-bounty/demo-artifacts/demo-artifacts/issue-5577-proposal-bid-validation-demo.mp4\n\nVerification:\n- node --test src/tests/*.js from apps/api\n- node --check src/controllers/proposalController.js\n- node --check src/validators/proposal.js\n- git diff --check","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:35:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645201228","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOBL8g","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5574\n\nPlan: add a focused user creation schema so `POST /api/users` validates `email`, `fullName`, and `role` before hitting the in-memory service, reject malformed payloads and unknown fields with a 400 response, add focused API regression tests, and attach a short demo video in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:38:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645211122","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOBaHQ","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nScoped issue: #5574\nPR: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/5590\n\nSummary: `POST /api/users` now validates the user payload before creating an in-memory user, rejects malformed payloads and unknown fields with a 400 response, and keeps valid user creation working with the default `client` role.\n\nDemo video: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dallasnetprofu02-design/bug-bounty/demo-artifacts/demo-artifacts/issue-5574-user-validation-demo.mp4\n\nVerification:\n- node --test src/tests/*.js from apps/api\n- node --check src/controllers/userController.js\n- node --check src/validators/user.js\n- git diff --check","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:39:55Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645214749","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOBrOA","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5560\n\nPlan: keep the service-only fix narrow by adding `createdAt` timestamps to in-memory proposal, review, message, and notification records so their shape matches the Prisma-backed models more closely, cover the behavior with a focused service regression test, and attach a short demo video in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:41:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645219128","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOBrOw","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nScoped issue: #5560\nPR: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/5563\n\nSummary: in-memory proposal, review, message, and notification services now return `createdAt` timestamps so their shape matches the Prisma-backed models more closely, while message `sentAt` stays aligned to the same timestamp.\n\nDemo video: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dallasnetprofu02-design/bug-bounty/demo-artifacts/demo-artifacts/issue-5560-created-at-demo.mp4\n\nVerification:\n- node --test apps/api/src/tests/serviceCreatedAt.test.js\n- node --check apps/api/src/tests/serviceCreatedAt.test.js\n- git diff --check","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:41:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645219131","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOCQcQ","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5587\n\nPlan: add a focused message creation schema so `POST /api/messages` validates non-empty content, a non-empty recipient id, and the 5000-character cap before hitting the in-memory service, add regression API tests for invalid and valid payloads, and attach a short demo video in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:44:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645228657","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOCeQA","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nScoped issue: #5587\nPR: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/5593\n\nSummary: `POST /api/messages` now validates message payloads before hitting the in-memory service, rejects empty, missing, and oversized content with a 400 response, and keeps valid message creation working.\n\nDemo video: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dallasnetprofu02-design/bug-bounty/demo-artifacts/demo-artifacts/issue-5587-message-validation-demo.mp4\n\nVerification:\n- node --test src/tests/*.js from apps/api\n- node --check src/controllers/messageController.js\n- node --check src/validators/message.js\n- git diff --check","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:45:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645232192","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFODCLQ","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5591\n\nPlan: add a focused notification creation schema so `POST /api/notifications` validates non-empty `type`, `message`, and `recipientId` before hitting the in-memory service, add regression API tests for empty and blank payloads plus the valid path, and attach a short demo video in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:48:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645241389","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFODPaw","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nScoped issue: #5591\nPR: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/5596\n\nSummary: `POST /api/notifications` now validates the notification payload before hitting the in-memory service, rejects empty and blank required fields with a 400 response, and keeps valid notification creation working.\n\nDemo video: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dallasnetprofu02-design/bug-bounty/demo-artifacts/demo-artifacts/issue-5591-notification-validation-demo.mp4\n\nVerification:\n- node --test src/tests/*.js from apps/api\n- node --check src/controllers/notificationController.js\n- node --check src/validators/notification.js\n- git diff --check","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:49:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645244779","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFODwXQ","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5583\n\nPlan: keep the fix to `authService` by generating the register user id once and reusing it for both the returned `id` and the signed token `sub`, then add a focused regression test that decodes the token and proves the subject matches the user id.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:51:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645253213","viewerDidAut