th flexible spacing after the scheme, trims the extracted credential before verification, and still rejects non-Bearer headers and invalid tokens.\n\nDemo video: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dallasnetprofu02-design/bug-bounty/demo-artifacts/demo-artifacts/issue-5595-auth-bearer-spacing-demo.mp4\n\nVerification:\n- node --test src/tests/authMiddleware.test.js\n- node --test src/tests/health.test.js src/tests/authMiddleware.test.js\n- node --check src/middleware/auth.js\n- node --check src/tests/authMiddleware.test.js","createdAt":"2026-06-08T03:55:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645278002","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOGhAQ","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5533\n\nPlan: add a focused payment creation validator so `POST /api/payments` rejects missing, negative, wrong-type, and unsupported-currency payloads before calling the payment service, while preserving the current `usd` default for valid amount-only requests.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T04:00:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645298433","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOGvsQ","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nScoped issue: #5533\nPR: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/5605\n\nSummary: `POST /api/payments` now validates payment payloads before reaching the payment service, rejects malformed amounts and unsupported currencies with a 400 response, and preserves the current `usd` default for valid amount-only requests.\n\nDemo video: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dallasnetprofu02-design/bug-bounty/demo-artifacts/demo-artifacts/issue-5533-payment-validation-demo.mp4\n\nVerification:\n- node --test src/tests/paymentValidation.test.js\n- node --test src/tests/health.test.js src/tests/paymentValidation.test.js\n- node --check src/controllers/paymentController.js\n- node --check src/validators/payment.js","createdAt":"2026-06-08T04:01:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645302193","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOHqlg","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5557\n\nPlan: read a configured frontend origin, allow browser CORS only for that origin while leaving same-origin/non-browser requests intact, and add a focused regression test proving trusted origins receive the CORS header while untrusted origins do not.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T04:03:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645317270","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOIDhA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Tail refresh after newer #743 same-bounty activity from @dallasnetprofu02-design, including fresh scoped PRs up through #5605.\n\nMy active #743 submissions remain:\n- PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n- PR #4511: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/4511\n\nCurrent live status rechecked now: both are OPEN, non-draft, bounty-claim labeled, `/claim #743` is present in the PR body, and `update-leaderboard` is green. No contributor-side WIP is pending from my side unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T04:04:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issu