Ogqcg","author":{"login":"dallasnetprofu02-design"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5645\n\nPlan: apply the existing `authMiddleware` only to `POST /api/messages`, preserve the current `GET /api/messages` behavior, add focused API regression coverage for public reads plus unauthenticated rejection and authenticated success on message creation, and attach a short demo video in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T05:30:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645726834","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOgtlg","author":{"login":"modelsbridgeaicom-ship-it"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5644\nPR: #5646\n\nCompleted a focused admin route authorization fix: authenticated non-admin users now receive 403 on `/api/admin/metrics`, while admin users retain access.\n\nValidation:\n- `node --test apps\\api\\src\\tests\\health.test.js apps\\api\\src\\tests\\adminRoutes.test.js`\n- `node --check apps\\api\\src\\middleware\\auth.js`\n- `node --check apps\\api\\src\\routes\\adminRoutes.js`\n- `node --check apps\\api\\src\\tests\\adminRoutes.test.js`\n- `git diff --check -- apps\\api\\src\\middleware\\auth.js apps\\api\\src\\routes\\adminRoutes.js`\n\nDemo: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/modelsbridgeaicom-ship-it/bug-bounty/codex/admin-role-5644/demos/admin-role-5644-demo.gif\n\nPayment details can be provided privately after maintainer acceptance.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T05:30:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645727638","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOhFPw","author":{"login":"michaelapollopimentel-svg"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5650\n\nPlan: add a focused review p