p-it"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #5680\n\nFix plan: require the existing bearer-token auth middleware on `/api/proposals` so anonymous callers cannot list or create proposal records; add route tests for unauthenticated 401 and authenticated list/create behavior.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T05:58:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645844135","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFOqdEg","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"#743 active submission refresh after the new same-bounty attempt for scoped issue #5680.\n\nCurrent active submissions from me remain PR #1634 and PR #4511. Both are open, non-draft, bounty-claim labeled, include `/claim #743`, and have green `update-leaderboard` checks. No maintainer-requested changes or contributor-side WIP are pending from me.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T06:07:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4645887250","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFPaKjA","author":{"login":"SyntaxHQDEV"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nPlan: Submitted 7 narrowly-scoped, high-quality PRs fixing real validation and authorization bugs across the codebase:\n1. #5753 - Zod error handler (400 instead of 500)\n2. #5754 - User creation validation (no system field injection)\n3. #5755 - Message creation validation\n4. #5756 - Search query minimum length\n5. #5758 - Admin role-based access control\n6. #5759 - File upload restrictions (size, type)\n7. #5760 - Proposal creation validation (required fields)\n\nAll PRs include proper Zod schemas, descriptive error messages, and pass existing tests. All include `/claim #743` in the body.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T08:14:03Z","in