pdate-leaderboard` checks.\n\nCurrent evidence:\n- PR #1634: freelancer search separator fix with demo artifact and build verification.\n- PR #4511: generated user id preservation with focused route regression coverage.\n\nNo maintainer-requested changes or contributor-side WIP are pending from me.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-06-08T11:25:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4648460238","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFRcRtQ","author":{"login":"AldrikM"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #5848\n\nPlan: register `/health` before the shared `apiLimiter` so health probes do not consume the API bucket, keep the security/parsing middleware unchanged, keep rate limiting active on `/api/*`, add focused regression coverage for repeated health checks, and attach a short demo artifact in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-06-08T12:06:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4648800693","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFRhQgg","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"#743 active submission refresh after scoped issue #5848.\n\nMy current active submissions remain PR #1634 and PR #4511. Both are open, non-draft, bounty-claim labeled, include `/claim #743`, and are MERGEABLE/CLEAN with green `update-leaderboard` checks.\n\n- PR #1634: freelancer search skill separator fix, demo/build evidence, `update-leaderboard` green.\n- PR #4511: preserves generated user ids during creation, focused route regression coverage, `update-leaderboard` green.\n\nNo contributor-side WIP or failing checks are pending from my side. Ready for maintainer review/merge on technical merit.\n\n/claim #743","createdAt":"2026-06-08T12:17:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":fa