nPR #6210 appears to be a separate navigation exposure slice for child issue #6208. This note is only to keep the already-submitted Taher-owned #743/#80 reward-row work visible while new child-issue activity continues on the parent bounty thread.\n\nNo contributor-side blocker is visible from my side. I can make any focused revision immediately if maintainers request one.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-09T18:52:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4663009028","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFfc5_A","author":{"login":"alejandrorivas-pixel"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nWorking from child issue #6220.\n\nPlan completed in PR #6221: fix registration so the returned user id and JWT subject use the same generated id, add deterministic regression coverage for Date.now advancing between calls, include a short MP4 demo artifact, and keep the change scoped to apps/api/src/services/authService.js plus tests.\n\n/claim #743","createdAt":"2026-06-09T19:55:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4663491068","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABFfeYPg","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"﻿/attempt #743\n\nVisibility refresh after the newer same-parent scoped issue #6220 / PR #6221 activity from @alejandrorivas-pixel at 2026-06-09T19:55Z.\n\nMy active Taher-owned #743 submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent PR #1634 status rechecked now:\n- OPEN, non-draft\n- MERGEABLE / CLEAN\n- has `🙋 Bounty claim`\n- includes `/claim #743`\n- `update-leaderboard` is SUCCESS\n- demo evidence remains attached in the PR body\n- Algora claim remains pending/reachable: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qM