d: 1, failed checks: 0\n\nThe newer PRs #3497/#3501/#3521 appear to be separate later submissions under the same parent issue. This note is only to keep the earlier active claim visible for review and payout ordering.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-12T15:46:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4692815639","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABF9TvQg","author":{"login":"ryuszi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #6864\n\nPlan:\n- Constrain public registration roles so self-service signup cannot mint `admin` claims.\n- Preserve safe public roles such as `client` and `freelancer`.\n- Add API regression coverage proving `role: admin` falls back to `client` in both the response and JWT claims, while `freelancer` remains valid.\n- Validate with the API test suite and include a short demo GIF in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-06-12T19:55:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4694798146","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABF9VIJA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nVisibility refresh after the newer same-bounty attempt from @ryuszi:\n- attempt: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4694652186\n- scoped issue: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/6864\n\nMy active #743 reward submission remains PR #1634: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent contributor-side status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft.\n- The bounty claim label is present.\n- The PR body includes `/claim #743`.\n- The `update-leaderboard` check has passed.\n- Algora claim remains Pending for USD 700: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nSco