e `Bounty claim` label is present.\n- The PR body includes `/claim #743`.\n- Merge state is `CLEAN` / mergeable.\n- The `update-leaderboard` check passed.\n\nScope remains distinct: PR #1634 fixes the freelancer search mojibake separator UI defect with demo/build evidence. The newer #7132/#7133 work covers unknown API route JSON 404 behavior, so it does not replace the earlier PR #1634 submission. No contributor-side change is pending on PR #1634 unless maintainers request a specific revision.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-15T09:27:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4706451645","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABGL8lSg","author":{"login":"cibaxhilajiao"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\n## Implementation Plan\nBuild a Python automation tool (`low_hanging_fruit.py`) that:\n1. Scans the codebase for security vulnerabilities using both regex patterns and logic-based rules\n2. Detects: broken authentication (no password hashing), hardcoded secrets, missing RBAC, stub implementations, XSS vectors\n3. Auto-creates well-structured GitHub issues with severity labels, descriptions, and remediation steps\n4. Supports recursive mode for continuous scanning\n5. Includes 19 unit tests covering all detection rules\n\nThe tool found 7 security issues in this repo (4 critical, 2 high, 1 medium).","createdAt":"2026-06-15T16:39:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4710147402","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABGMDUxA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nVisibility refresh after the newer same-issue activity from @cibaxhilajiao:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4710147402\n\nMy active Tah