e fields still pass through.","createdAt":"2026-06-17T02:37:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4725392701","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABGafoUg","author":{"login":"z272258483"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #7720\n\nPlan: update the API workspace test script so Node's built-in test runner targets concrete `src/tests/*.test.js` files instead of trying to load the `src/tests` directory as a module. Validate with `npm test -w apps/api` and `git diff --check`.","createdAt":"2026-06-17T02:40:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4725401682","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABGagerw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nConsolidated visibility refresh after the newer same-issue #743 attempt burst from @z272258483, latest observed here:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4725401682\n\nMy active earlier #743 submission remains PR #1634:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft.\n- The PR has the bounty claim label.\n- The PR body includes `/claim #743` and references #743.\n- The visible update-leaderboard check is passing.\n\nThe newer attempts appear to be later adjacent submissions under the same parent bounty. This note is only to keep the earlier active claim visible for review and payout ordering. No maintainer-requested change or contributor-side blocker is pending from my side.\n","createdAt":"2026-06-17T02:43:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4725415599","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABGasHRw","author":{"login":"z272258483"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #7737\n\nPlan: replace the API's default open CORS middleware with a small configurable allowlist helper. Allow requests without an Origin header for server-to-server and tests, allow all origins only when no allowlist is configured, reject disallowed browser origins, and add focused CORS regression tests.","createdAt":"2026-06-17T03:28:42Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4725606215","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABGasuTg","author":{"login":"z272258483"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #7739\n\nPlan: add a configurable Multer file-size limit for the upload endpoint, translate Multer LIMIT_FILE_SIZE failures into a clear 413 JSON response, preserve valid small uploads, and add focused route tests using a small test-only limit.","createdAt":"2026-06-17T03:30:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4725616206","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABGateaw","author":{"login":"z272258483"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #7741\n\nPlan: teach the API error handler to translate body-parser JSON parse failures into 400 responses and request-size failures into 413 responses while preserving the existing 500 fallback for unexpected errors. Add route-level regression tests for malformed JSON and oversized JSON payloads.","createdAt":"2026-06-17T03:33:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment