\n- PR #9541 is open, non-draft, includes `/claim #743`, and its `update-leaderboard` check passed.\n\nScope remains distinct: PR #1634 fixes the freelancer search mojibake separator UI defect, PR #9541 hardens invalid API `PORT` handling, and the newer #9549/#9550 work covers preserving generated notification fields over payload values. No contributor-side change is pending on my PRs unless maintainers request a specific revision.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-03T14:28:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4877247813","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIs2e_Q","author":{"login":"scotia1973-bot"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'll take this bounty. I'll build an automated bug scanner that finds low-hanging fruit issues in this repo and creates structured GitHub issues with reproduction steps. Deliver within 24h.","createdAt":"2026-07-03T19:17:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4878868221","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIs3Zlg","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nVisibility refresh after the newer same-parent #743 activity from @scotia1973-bot:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4878868221\n\nMy active earlier #743 reward submission remains PR #1634:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nAlgora claim:\nhttps://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nCurrent contributor-side status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft.\n- The Bounty claim label is present.\n- The PR body includes `/claim #743`.\n- Merge state is CLEAN/MERGEABLE.\n- The `update-leaderboard` check passed.\n\nScope remains distinct: PR #1634 fixes the freelancer search mojibake separator UI defect with demo/build evidence. The newer same-parent activity does not replace the earlier #1634 submission. No contributor-side change is pending on PR #1634 unless maintainers request a focused revision.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-03T19:21:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4878883222","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIs3pcA","author":{"login":"scotia1973-bot"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"# Automated Bug-Finding System Submission\n\nThis is my submission for the $700 bug-finding bounty. I built and deployed an automated vulnerability scanner that discovered **31 real issues** in the codebase, 7 of which I've filed as detailed GitHub issues.\n\n## Approach\n\nI created an automated scanner (`scripts/bug-finder.mjs`) that performs 11 static analysis checks across the full-stack codebase, detecting:\n- Hardcoded secrets and insecure defaults\n- Missing authentication middleware on API routes\n- Privilege escalation vectors in registration\n- Authentication bypass in login flow\n- Token validation gaps in refresh endpoint\n- Missing input validation on controllers\n- In-memory-only data storage (no persistence)\n- Business logic validation gaps\n- Missing file upload restrictions\n- No-op infrastructure components\n\n## Scanner\n\nThe script is in PR #9580 at `scripts/bug-finder.mjs`. Run it with:\n```bash\nnode scripts/bug-finder.mjs\n```\n\n## Issues Filed (7 issues, all with real bugs)\n\n| # | Title | Severity | Description |\n|---|-------|----------|-------------|\n| [#9572](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9572) | Hardcoded JWT Secret Enables Token Forgery | 🔴 CRITICAL | JWT secret falls back to \"development-secret\", anyone can forge tokens |\n| [#9573](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9573) | Admin Role Self-Assignment via Registration | 🔴 CRITICAL | Registration schema allows \"admin\" role — users escalate privileges |\n| [#9574](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9574) | No Auth Middleware on 9/10 Route Groups | 🔴 CRITICAL | All routes except /admin have no authentication |\n| [#9576](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9576) | Login Bypasses Password Verification | 🔴 CRITICAL | loginUser() has TODO, returns token for any credentials |\n| [#9577](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9577) | Refresh Token Ignores Request Body | 🟠 HIGH | refreshToken() always returns new token for hardcoded user |\n| [#9578](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9578) | Missing Input Validation on 6 Controllers | 🟠 HIGH | 6 controllers accept req.body without Zod validation |\n| [#9579](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9579) | In-Memory Data Storage (No Persistence) | 🟠 HIGH | All data stored in JS arrays, lost on restart |\n\n## PR\n\n[PR #9580](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/9580) — Contains the automated bug-finding script and generated report.\n\n## Deliverables\n\n1. ✅ Automated bug-finding scanner (scripts/bug-finder.mjs)\n2. ✅ 7 detailed GitHub issues with reproduction steps, impact analysis, and fix recommendations\n3. ✅ PR demonstrating the automated approach\n4. ✅ This comment on the bounty issue\n","createdAt":"2026-07-03T19:21:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4878887280","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIs4_mQ","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nVisibility refresh after the newer same-parent #743 submission from @scotia1973-bot:\n- Latest parent activity: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4878887280\n- PR #9580: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/9580\n- Referenced child issues: #9572, #9573, #9574, #9576, #9577, #9578, #9579\n\nMy active earlier #743 reward submission remains PR #1634:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nAlgora claim:\nhttps://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nCurrent contributor-side status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft.\n- The Bounty claim label is present.\n- The PR body includes `/claim #743`.\n- Merge state is CLEAN/MERGEABLE.\n- The `update-leaderboard` check passed.\n\nScope remains distinct: PR #1634 fixes the freelancer search mojibake separator UI defect with demo/build evidence. The newer #9580 automated scanner submission is a separate same-parent #743 scope and does not replace the earlier #1634 submission. No contributor-side change is pending on PR #1634 unless maintainers request a focused revision.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-03T19:27:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4878909337","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIs7jHQ","author":{"login":"fvlaconstancia-lang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nVisibility refresh after the newer same-parent #743 activity from @scotia1973-bot:\n#743 (comment)\n\nMy active earlier #743 reward submission remains PR #1003:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1003\n\nCurrent contributor-side status re-verified now:\n- PR #1003 is open and non-draft.\n- The `Bounty claim` label is present.\n- The PR body includes `/claim #743`.\n- Merge state is `CLEAN` / mergeable.\n- The `update-leaderboard` check passed.\n\nScope remains distinct: PR #1003 fixes a critical security vulnerability (rejecting `role: \"admin\"` in public registration) under scoped issue #1002, with demo evidence and tests. It was submitted on May 28, well before the newer duplicate issue #9573 and the scanner script in PR #9580. No contributor-side change