alidate with the targeted service test, the API test suite, and `git diff --check`\n\nDisclosure: this focused patch will be prepared with AI assistance and validated locally before PR submission.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T02:36:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4880347607","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIuRwYA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nClaim/status refresh after the newer same-parent #743 attempt from @Lynn-Lee:\n- Latest external activity: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4880347607\n- Referenced scoped issue: #9632\n\nMy active earlier #743 reward submission remains PR #1634:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent contributor-side status re-verified now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft.\n- The `Bounty claim` label is present.\n- The PR body includes `/claim #743`.\n- Merge state is `CLEAN` / mergeable.\n- `update-leaderboard` passed.\n\nScope remains distinct: PR #1634 fixes the freelancer search mojibake separator UI defect with demo/build evidence. The newer #9632 attempt is a separate payload-override/UID scope and does not replace the earlier PR #1634 submission. No contributor-side change is pending on PR #1634 unless maintainers request a specific revision.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-04T02:41:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4880363616","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIv8r8w","author":{"login":"camellialinfei"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #9703\n\nPlan:\n- Add a Zod schema for payment requests.\n- Reject invalid payment bodies with HTTP 400 before the service layer.\n- Pass normalized payment data to createPaymentIntent().\n- Add endpoint tests for invalid and valid payment requests.\n\nDisclosure: this focused security hardening patch was prepared with AI assistance and validated locally.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T13:12:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4882115571","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIv_T_g","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nVisibility refresh after newer same-parent #743 payment-validation activity from @camellialinfei:\n- Attempt/scoped issue: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9703\n- Newer PR: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/9704\n\nMy earlier active Taher-owned payment-validation #743 submission remains PR #9465:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/9465\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now:\n- PR #9465 is open and non-draft.\n- PR #9465 includes `/claim #743` and closes its scoped issue #9303.\n- GitHub shows `update-leaderboard:SUCCESS`.\n- No maintainer-requested change is pending from my side unless maintainers ask for a focused revision.\n\nThe newer same-parent payment-validation PR does not replace the earlier active #9465 claim/submission unless maintainers decide otherwise.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T13:24:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4882158590","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIwIroQ","author":{"login":"luccas12348486"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Submission for Bounty #743\n\n**Scoped issue:** #9715 — `POST /api/proposals` accepts empty/unvalidated payloads\n**PR:** #9717 — Adds Zod schema validation to proposals endpoint\n\n**Fix:**\n- Created `validators/proposal.js` following existing `validators/job.js` pattern\n- Added `createProposalSchema` with required fields: jobId, coverLetter, proposedRate, estimatedDuration, skills\n- Updated `proposalController.js` to use `.parse()` before calling `createProposal()`\n\n**Verified:** Code compiles, follows existing patterns, no regressions introduced.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T14:02:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4882312097","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIwulNw","author":{"login":"changliuchang777"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"﻿/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #9759\n\nPlan:\n- Upgrade the API direct Multer dependency from `^2.1.1` to `^2.2.0` to leave the vulnerable audit range.\n- Keep the patch limited to `apps/api/package.json` and `package-lock.json`.\n- Validate with `npm audit --json`, `npm test --workspace apps/api`, `npm run build --workspace apps/web`, and `git diff --check`.\n\nDisclosure: this focused dependency security patch is being prepared with AI assistance and will be locally validated before PR submission.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-04T15:55:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4882933047","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIxj_VA","author":{"login":"changliuchang777"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #10314\n\nPlan:\n- Catch Zod validation failures in the auth register/login controller paths.\n- Return the existing API JSON error shape with HTTP 400 for invalid request bodies.\n- Add focused API regression tests for invalid register and login payloads.\n- Validate with focused auth tests, full API tests, web build, and git diff check.\n\nDisclosure: this focused API validation patch is being prepared with AI assistance and validated locally before PR submission.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T21:07:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4883808084","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIx3clw","author":{"login":"designartvis"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #10598\n\nPlan:\n- Restrict public registration roles to `client` and `freelancer` so callers cannot self-assign `admin`.\n- Keep omitted role defaulting to `client`.\n- Add focused API regression tests for default registration, freelancer registration, and admin-role rejection before token creation.\n- Validate with `npm test` and a short local API demonstration.\n\nDisclosure: this focused security fix is being prepared with AI assistance and will be locally validated before PR submission.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T23:25:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4884126871","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIx4TMw","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nVisibility refresh after newer same-parent #743 activity since my last status note:\n- @luccas12348486 submission for #9715 / PR #9717: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4882312097\n- @changliuchang777 attempt for #9759: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4882933047\n- @changliuchang777 attempt for #10314: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4883808084\n- @designartvis attempt for #10598: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4884126871\n\nMy earlier active #743 reward submission remains PR #1634:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nAlgora claim:\nhttps://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft.\n- The `Bounty claim` label is present.\n- The PR body includes `/claim #743`.\n- GitHub reports the PR as mergeable / clean.\n- The `update-leaderboard` check passed.\n\nScope remains distinct: PR #1634 fixes the freelancer search mojibake separator UI defect with demo/build evidence. The newer same-parent activity covers proposal validation, Multer dependency/audit scope, auth validation error handling, and public registration role validation, so it does not replace the earlier PR #1634 submission.\n\nNo contributor-side change is pending on PR #1634 unless maintainers request a specific revision. This refresh is only to keep the earlier Taher-owned #743 claim visible for review/payment tracking.","createdAt":"2026-07-04T23:32:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4884140851","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIyHl_Q","author":{"login":"wousp112"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nI created a scoped child issue for CORS origin restriction and am implementing a narrow API patch: configure CORS from an explicit allowed-origin env value with a local development default, then add regression tests for allowed and disallowed origins.\n\nValidation plan:\n- `npm test -w apps/api`\n- `git diff --check`\n","createdAt":"2026-07-05T01:22:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4884391421","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABIyMNDw","author":{"login":"wousp112"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nI created scoped issue #10843 and am working on a focused API config hardening fix: keep the development JWT fallback locally, reject production startup wh