teReview()` calls in the same millisecond cannot reuse the same `rev_` id.\n- Preserve the existing `rev_` prefix and keep the change scoped to `apps/api/src/services/reviewService.js` plus focused service tests.\n- Validate with `npm test -w apps/api` before submitting a PR.\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-06T00:58:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4888266842","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABI10-cQ","author":{"login":"foxsaying"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nSubmitted PR #10932: https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/10932\n\nScoped issue: #10931\n\nScope:\n- Replace same-millisecond `Date.now()` review ids with server-owned `rev_` + UUID ids.\n- Add focused regression coverage proving two same-millisecond `createReview()` calls produce distinct ids.\n- Keep the patch limited to review id generation, focused tests, and the API test script needed for the documented workspace test command.\n\nVerification:\n- `node --test ./src/tests/reviewService.test.js`\n- `npm test -w apps/api`\n- `git diff --check`\r\n","createdAt":"2026-07-06T01:02:40Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4888280689","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABI2Exjw","author":{"login":"Xinnygh"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue created: #10935\n\nPlan:\n- Update the shared UI Button so it accepts native button props via React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>.\n- Default the rendered button to type=\"button\" when callers do not provide type.\n- Forward props such as disabled, aria-*, onClick, className, and explicit type=\"submit\".\n- Preserve existing inline visual styling while allowing caller-provided style to extend/override defaults.\n- Keep the patch limited to packages/ui/src/Button.tsx.\n\nValidation completed locally before PR:\n- npx tsc --noEmit --jsx react-jsx --moduleResolution bundler --module esnext --target es2022 --lib dom,dom.iterable,esnext --esModuleInterop --skipLibCheck packages/ui/src/Button.tsx\n- npm run build -w apps/web\n- node --test apps/api/src/tests/*.test.js","createdAt":"2026-07-06T02:13:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4888539535","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABI2J9FA","author":{"login":"Lynn-Lee"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #10937\n\nPlan:\n- update `apps/api/src/services/authService.js` so `loginUser()` verifies registered email/password before issuing a JWT\n- reject unknown users and wrong passwords with `401` while preserving the current route contract for valid logins\n- sign the access token with the registered user's real `id` and `role`, and add focused auth route/service regression coverage\n\nVerification plan:\n- `npm test -w apps/api`\n- `git diff --check`\n","createdAt":"2026-07-06T02:35:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4888624404","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABI2u_jQ","author":{"login":"shangguanwt"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #10940\n\nPlan: keep job creation server-owned by preventing caller payloads from overriding the generated `job_` id or default `status: open`, then add focused service-level regression coverage and a short demo video.","createdAt":"2026-07-06T04:57:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4889231245","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABI2yaSA","author":{"login":"dev-nana27"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/try","createdAt":"2026-07-06T05:07:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4889287240","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABI3hGIQ","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nVisibility refresh after newer same-parent #743 activity, latest `/try` from @dev-nana27:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4889287240\n\nMy active earlier #743 reward submission remains PR #1634:\nhttps://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/pull/1634\n\nCurrent contributor-side status rechecked now:\n- PR #1634 is open and non-draft.\n- The Bounty claim label is present.\n- The PR body includes `/claim #743` and closes scoped issue #1632.\n- GitHub reports merge state CLEAN.\n- `update-leaderboard` succeeded.\n- Algora claim remains indexed: https://algora.io/claims/ejgQ9qMrytjoa441\n\nScope remains distinct: PR #1634 fixes the freelancer search mojibake separator UI defect with demo/build evidence. The newer #743 comments and scoped attempts are separate same-parent activity and do not replace the earlier PR #1634 submission unless maintainers decide otherwise. No contributor-side revision is pending unless maintainers request one.","createdAt":"2026-07-06T07:10:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4890052129","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABI7IVDg","author":{"login":"cnbright"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped issue: #10960\n\nPlan: update the shared Card component so it forwards native section props such as className, id, aria-*, data-*, and style while preserving the existing title/children rendering and default card styling. Keep the patch limited to packages/ui/src/Card.tsx, validate with a focused TypeScript compile command and git diff --check, then open a PR with /claim #10960 and /claim #743.","createdAt":"2026-07-06T14:17:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4893840654","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABI_woOg","author":{"login":"AKUMA-creator-ng"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"For the dependency dashboard, VulnLedger can be the underlying scanning engine:\n\n```bash\npip install vulnledger\nvulnledger scan . --json\n```\n\nThe JSON output includes every dependency with version, license, and known vulnerabilities. You can parse this to populate your dashboard.","createdAt":"2026-07-06T23:56:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4898695226","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABJAzaKQ","author":{"login":"es3298"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #743\n\nConsolidated es3298 status refresh after bringing all active scoped submissions current.\n\nActive creator-owned child issues / PRs:\n- #10871 -> PR #10872: payment currency normalization\n- #10873 -> PR #10874: notification id/read server-owned hardening\n- #10875 -> PR #10876: message id/sentAt server-owned hardening\n- #10905 -> PR #10906: admin metrics require admin role\n- #10923 -> PR #10924: search q query normalization\n- #10926 -> PR #10927: registration token subject matches returned user id\n\nCurrent contributor-side status:\n- all six PRs are open and non-draft\n- all six PR bodies include `/claim #743`\n- all six PRs close their scoped child issue\n- all six merge states are CLEAN\n- all six include demo evidence in the PR body\n- focused tests, `npm test --workspace apps/api`, and `git diff --check` have been re-run after rebasing onto current main\n\nNo contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-07-07T03:19:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4899789353","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABJA_OOQ","author":{"login":"hyperxiaoerxz-hash"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped child issue: #10970\n\nPlan:\n- Protect `GET /api/users` with `authMiddleware` so anonymous callers cannot enumerate user records.\n- Preserve authenticated listing behavior.\n- Add route regression coverage for anonymous 401 and authenticated 200 responses.\n- Validate with focused API tests and diff checks before opening a PR.","createdAt":"2026-07-07T04:01:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4899982905","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABJBBf1Q","author":{"login":"hyperxiaoerxz-hash"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped child issue: #10972\n\nPlan:\n- Pin `apps/web` Turbopack root to the repository workspace in `next.config.js`.\n- Keep build behavior otherwise unchanged.\n- Validate that `npm run build -w apps/web` succeeds without the workspace-root inference warning.\n- Avoid committing generated `next-env.d.ts` side effects.","createdAt":"2026-07-07T04:08:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/743#issuecomment-4900020181","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABJBDl8Q","author":{"login":"hyperxiaoerxz-hash"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #743\n\nScoped child issue: #10976\n\nPlan:\n- Make proposal ids collision-